(875502, 99432, 25183, '<td valign="top">Having raised bettas, I know this scene well....too bad the clutter around the bowl is a bit distracting.  I did enjoy the shot!</td>', 'Having raised bettas, I know this scene well....too bad the clutter around the bowl is a bit distracting.  I did enjoy the shot!', '2004-08-25 01:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
