(875529, 98885, 21362, '<td valign="top">Aww, I used to have a pet chinchilla. They are so cute! This makes me miss him. A lot of people didn''t know what one was when I mentioned him, I wonder if you''ll get any comments like that.<br/> <br/>Cute pic. Focus a touch on the soft side?</td>', 'Aww, I used to have a pet chinchilla. They are so cute! This makes me miss him. A lot of people didn''t know what one was when I mentioned him, I wonder if you''ll get any comments like that. Cute pic. Focus a touch on the soft side?', '2004-08-25 01:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(875530, 99405, 23312, '<td valign="top">It looks like some kind of reflections are washing out the colors in the glass - perhaps a polarizer would help?</td>', 'It looks like some kind of reflections are washing out the colors in the glass - perhaps a polarizer would help?', '2004-08-25 01:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(875533, 99780, 12061, '<td valign="top">The focus is a tad off, as well, the hand is a bit too bright, so it doesn''t quite fit the mood of the lovely landscape in the background. It almost stands out too much when it should be as dramatic as the background is</td>', 'The focus is a tad off, as well, the hand is a bit too bright, so it doesn''t quite fit the mood of the lovely landscape in the background. It almost stands out too much when it should be as dramatic as the background is', '2004-08-25 01:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
