(875895, 99691, 25203, '<td valign="top">How is this ironic? <br/>The Dictionary:  At its most basic, a difference or gap between the presentation/representation of something and its reality. In other words, when what something appears to be and what it is are not the same.<br/>Vodka is to be appreciated, not scorned.  Now it''s not Gray Goose but it''s better than water.</td>', 'How is this ironic? The Dictionary:  At its most basic, a difference or gap between the presentation/representation of something and its reality. In other words, when what something appears to be and what it is are not the same.Vodka is to be appreciated, not scorned.  Now it''s not Gray Goose but it''s better than water.', '2004-08-25 02:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(875896, 99553, 93, '<td valign="top">This is a *great* photograph!  I''m wondering how it would have played out with a darker background.. to emphasize the candle''s light.</td>', 'This is a *great* photograph!  I''m wondering how it would have played out with a darker background.. to emphasize the candle''s light.', '2004-08-25 02:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(875897, 99351, 24805, '<td valign="top">feels original. keep it up</td>', 'feels original. keep it up', '2004-08-25 02:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(875898, 99821, 25224, '<td valign="top">I like the creepy angel.  she needs better lighting.  she reminds me of my grandmothers house, and the strange girl who lives in a drawer of moth balls.  also, what''s up with her eyes.  I like the idea though, and I think better lighting would have been more effective.</td>', 'I like the creepy angel.  she needs better lighting.  she reminds me of my grandmothers house, and the strange girl who lives in a drawer of moth balls.  also, what''s up with her eyes.  I like the idea though, and I think better lighting would have been more effective.', '2004-08-25 02:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(875899, 99869, 93, '<td valign="top">The lighting and contrast in this photograph are exquisite! Very beautiful little girl.</td>', 'The lighting and contrast in this photograph are exquisite! Very beautiful little girl.', '2004-08-25 02:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(875900, 99929, 24805, '<td valign="top">right on. this is very cool. I think the trees could have been framed better though. 8</td>', 'right on. this is very cool. I think the trees could have been framed better though. 8', '2004-08-25 02:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(875901, 99633, 93, '<td valign="top">I like the concept. The shot seems a little tilted.</td>', 'I like the concept. The shot seems a little tilted.', '2004-08-25 02:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(875902, 99778, 24805, '<td valign="top">good work. the hue feels a little off and the grain greatly damages the image. perhaps slightly less saturation in the greens?</td>', 'good work. the hue feels a little off and the grain greatly damages the image. perhaps slightly less saturation in the greens?', '2004-08-25 02:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(875903, 99912, 25224, '<td valign="top">I like the idea.  I''d feel more hopeful if the mirror was in focus, and the ambulance was moving.  Also, the guy walking away from the truck looks really depressed.  I''m concerned.  Did someone die?  I''m not feeling very hopeful any more.  Still, this is one of the better one''s I''ve seen so far.</td>', 'I like the idea.  I''d feel more hopeful if the mirror was in focus, and the ambulance was moving.  Also, the guy walking away from the truck looks really depressed.  I''m concerned.  Did someone die?  I''m not feeling very hopeful any more.  Still, this is one of the better one''s I''ve seen so far.', '2004-08-25 02:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(875907, 99794, 93, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been a better photograph without the remnants of tears. She seems more worried than hopeful to me.</td>', 'I think this would have been a better photograph without the remnants of tears. She seems more worried than hopeful to me.', '2004-08-25 02:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
