(876251, 98980, 9295, '<td valign="top">Assuming the light is natural and not a special effect, this is my favorite of the challenge.I love how the moonlight catches the waves and brings out the texture of the sky and how the white lighthouse and yellow beam are such a stark contrast against the richer blues and blacks, really drawing your eye there. Beautifully captured. Good luck.</td>', 'Assuming the light is natural and not a special effect, this is my favorite of the challenge.I love how the moonlight catches the waves and brings out the texture of the sky and how the white lighthouse and yellow beam are such a stark contrast against the richer blues and blacks, really drawing your eye there. Beautifully captured. Good luck.', '2004-08-25 08:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
