(876259, 98908, 19952, '<td valign="top">Really great picture for this challenge and a nice effect. Very nice job!</td>', 'Really great picture for this challenge and a nice effect. Very nice job!', '2004-08-25 08:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(876262, 98612, 21551, '<td valign="top">i love it - beautiful</td>', 'i love it - beautiful', '2004-08-25 08:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(876263, 99058, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely wedding portrait. I like the way the veil sweeps out to mirror the gown''s train, filling up the left side of the shot. I think the little yellow flowers speckling the grass are a subtly exquisite touch, espeically the few that pop up in front of the gown. There is also a cluster of foliage to the left that is a nice spray of texture, balancing that half of the shot. It''s hard to tell but the groom doesn''t appear to be looking at the camera and his tuxedo blends a bit too much into the shadows of the background. Not a big deal, but for me, it''s the only thing that prevents this from being a PERFECT wedding portrait.  I gave this a 7 but I''m going to up it to an 8. Good luck.</td>', 'This is a lovely wedding portrait. I like the way the veil sweeps out to mirror the gown''s train, filling up the left side of the shot. I think the little yellow flowers speckling the grass are a subtly exquisite touch, espeically the few that pop up in front of the gown. There is also a cluster of foliage to the left that is a nice spray of texture, balancing that half of the shot. It''s hard to tell but the groom doesn''t appear to be looking at the camera and his tuxedo blends a bit too much into the shadows of the background. Not a big deal, but for me, it''s the only thing that prevents this from being a PERFECT wedding portrait.  I gave this a 7 but I''m going to up it to an 8. Good luck.', '2004-08-25 08:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(876266, 99013, 3569, '<td valign="top">Looks like the figure is walking the wrong way</td>', 'Looks like the figure is walking the wrong way', '2004-08-25 08:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(876267, 99058, 14386, '<td valign="top">A top-rate wedding picture. Excellent colors and composition. Though pose, it speaks a lot of hope, wishes and optimism. Congratulations to them and to you.</td>', 'A top-rate wedding picture. Excellent colors and composition. Though pose, it speaks a lot of hope, wishes and optimism. Congratulations to them and to you.', '2004-08-25 08:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(876271, 99495, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is a really great stock image and an excellent photo. It might benefit from a higher f-stop to get the bottom right corner in focus, but otherwise the clarity and focus are excellent. If you haven''t already, I hope you are able to sell it to a stock photo company.</td>', 'This is a really great stock image and an excellent photo. It might benefit from a higher f-stop to get the bottom right corner in focus, but otherwise the clarity and focus are excellent. If you haven''t already, I hope you are able to sell it to a stock photo company.', '2004-08-25 08:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(876272, 99071, 14603, '<td valign="top">At last.. a picture which does represent "hope" and well taken into the bargain.<br/>Well done...8</td>', 'At last.. a picture which does represent "hope" and well taken into the bargain.Well done...8', '2004-08-25 08:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(876273, 99090, 14386, '<td valign="top">Powerful picture. I REALLY hope you do well...last time I have a similar picture for strength, I was voted down for its religious tone. I am giving you a 10.</td>', 'Powerful picture. I REALLY hope you do well...last time I have a similar picture for strength, I was voted down for its religious tone. I am giving you a 10.', '2004-08-25 08:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(876275, 99923, 14386, '<td valign="top">Very nice...the composition looks a bit contrived but I like the contrast in the texture. A good shot for top 10!</td>', 'Very nice...the composition looks a bit contrived but I like the contrast in the texture. A good shot for top 10!', '2004-08-25 08:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(876287, 99071, 15204, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  I think the lighting is wonderful and I really like the b&amp;w.  I think the crop could be changed slightly, maybe you want to crop off all of Dad''s ear (or include the whole ear in the shot). - 8</td>', 'Great capture.  I think the lighting is wonderful and I really like the b&w.  I think the crop could be changed slightly, maybe you want to crop off all of Dad''s ear (or include the whole ear in the shot). - 8', '2004-08-25 09:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(876292, 98528, 15204, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and angle.  I love the idea - watering a new, tiny tree - and the birdhouse sitting by waiting adds to it.  I also like the negative space of the clear sky.  I would have liked a little less shadow on the girl''s face, so we could see her expression better. - 8</td>', 'Excellent composition and angle.  I love the idea - watering a new, tiny tree - and the birdhouse sitting by waiting adds to it.  I also like the negative space of the clear sky.  I would have liked a little less shadow on the girl''s face, so we could see her expression better. - 8', '2004-08-25 09:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(876311, 99779, 5354, '<td valign="top">point to note for future submission:<br/>horizon - needs to be horizontal, this one slopes down to the right.<br/>leading lines - need to take you to a focal point, in this shot the wall takes you in nicely but the turns and leads the eye out of frame.<br/>lack of focal point - why not use a hard hat, yellow or red would at least give the image some colour.<br/> <br/>as it is the image is bland and dull, and really stretches the theme of hope, though I can follow the reasoning. It''s not going to be a ribbon is it ?</td>', 'point to note for future submission:horizon - needs to be horizontal, this one slopes down to the right.leading lines - need to take you to a focal point, in this shot the wall takes you in nicely but the turns and leads the eye out of frame.lack of focal point - why not use a hard hat, yellow or red would at least give the image some colour. as it is the image is bland and dull, and really stretches the theme of hope, though I can follow the reasoning. It''s not going to be a ribbon is it ?', '2004-08-25 09:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(876314, 99895, 5354, '<td valign="top">I had a similar thought about using a plant in a real hard situation.<br/> <br/>This is nice but doesn''t have any WOW - it sin''t going to ribbon is it?<br/>Everything appears to be in the midground, and is flatter for that. How about bringing the plant up close and letting that railcar fade into a blurred background, but one which is still recognisable.</td>', 'I had a similar thought about using a plant in a real hard situation. This is nice but doesn''t have any WOW - it sin''t going to ribbon is it?Everything appears to be in the midground, and is flatter for that. How about bringing the plant up close and letting that railcar fade into a blurred background, but one which is still recognisable.', '2004-08-25 09:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(876316, 99764, 5354, '<td valign="top">feels just a tad soft in the focus, especially the beak. Did she move as you were taking the shot ?</td>', 'feels just a tad soft in the focus, especially the beak. Did she move as you were taking the shot ?', '2004-08-25 09:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(876320, 98946, 5354, '<td valign="top">pushing the limit of the challenge imo, but nice enough</td>', 'pushing the limit of the challenge imo, but nice enough', '2004-08-25 09:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(876324, 99762, 5354, '<td valign="top">Nice moon rise, but I''m struggling to see the bridge, or any connection with hope</td>', 'Nice moon rise, but I''m struggling to see the bridge, or any connection with hope', '2004-08-25 09:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(876330, 99781, 5354, '<td valign="top">I''d love to understand your thought processes connecting lighthouse with hope. I''m really struggling with it.<br/> <br/>However, as a lighthouse image I find this really excellent work, great tonal quality and composition.<br/> <br/>now how do I mark this ... I may have to come back when I''ve seen the rest.</td>', 'I''d love to understand your thought processes connecting lighthouse with hope. I''m really struggling with it. However, as a lighthouse image I find this really excellent work, great tonal quality and composition. now how do I mark this ... I may have to come back when I''ve seen the rest.', '2004-08-25 09:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(876339, 99876, 5354, '<td valign="top">Well its nice enough, but its got a ''snapshot'' quality which is going to go against it.<br/> <br/>The background clutter really takes the eye away from the main focal point. I think you could have chosen a different viewpoint to eliminate the clutter. Also those shadows entering the frame from right bottom really don''t help.<br/> <br/>Hits the challenge, but drastically let down in execution.</td>', 'Well its nice enough, but its got a ''snapshot'' quality which is going to go against it. The background clutter really takes the eye away from the main focal point. I think you could have chosen a different viewpoint to eliminate the clutter. Also those shadows entering the frame from right bottom really don''t help. Hits the challenge, but drastically let down in execution.', '2004-08-25 09:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(876341, 99705, 14603, '<td valign="top">There is a real look of hope and expectation on the young girls face.<br/>The lighting and shallow DOF work well to give the image impact.<br/>Superbly set up and modelled, I have absolutely no doubts that this will ribbon (hope that doesn`t jinx you)....great work....10</td>', 'There is a real look of hope and expectation on the young girls face.The lighting and shallow DOF work well to give the image impact.Superbly set up and modelled, I have absolutely no doubts that this will ribbon (hope that doesn`t jinx you)....great work....10', '2004-08-25 09:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(876345, 99367, 5354, '<td valign="top">Whats the zig zaggy thing over the painting ? - very distracting, but then i guess you would fall foul of the ''artwork'' rule if it was not there..<br/> <br/>sorry - not too impressed with this</td>', 'Whats the zig zaggy thing over the painting ? - very distracting, but then i guess you would fall foul of the ''artwork'' rule if it was not there.. sorry - not too impressed with this', '2004-08-25 09:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(876349, 99875, 15204, '<td valign="top">The little girls'' expressions are great.  I think the glaring light at the top of the frame detracts from the shot.</td>', 'The little girls'' expressions are great.  I think the glaring light at the top of the frame detracts from the shot.', '2004-08-25 09:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(876350, 98795, 5354, '<td valign="top">nice sunrise / set, but thats all I can say<br/>there needs to be some other aspect to the image than a pure sunrise - well at least in my opinion</td>', 'nice sunrise / set, but thats all I can saythere needs to be some other aspect to the image than a pure sunrise - well at least in my opinion', '2004-08-25 09:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(876356, 98980, 15204, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and excellent coposition.  I really love the way the light shines here.  It works great in this shot.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and excellent coposition.  I really love the way the light shines here.  It works great in this shot.', '2004-08-25 10:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(876358, 99165, 5354, '<td valign="top">pushing the limit of the challenge in my opinion, but I won''r mark you down for that.<br/> <br/>Everything is in the mid ground to distance, this really needs something close up to give the image an anchor point, the tree doesn''t really do it for me</td>', 'pushing the limit of the challenge in my opinion, but I won''r mark you down for that. Everything is in the mid ground to distance, this really needs something close up to give the image an anchor point, the tree doesn''t really do it for me', '2004-08-25 10:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(876364, 98706, 5354, '<td valign="top">Title hits the mark, but what the northern lights/clouds have to do with it is a mystery to me.</td>', 'Title hits the mark, but what the northern lights/clouds have to do with it is a mystery to me.', '2004-08-25 10:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(876365, 98616, 14603, '<td valign="top">Good composition and nice lighting..I especially like the way the person is "emerging" from the shadows. Good expression from the model which fits the theme nicely.<br/>Good work</td>', 'Good composition and nice lighting..I especially like the way the person is "emerging" from the shadows. Good expression from the model which fits the theme nicely.Good work', '2004-08-25 10:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(876366, 99370, 5354, '<td valign="top">Nice, fits the challenge well.<br/>Looks as though you had to twist his arm to sit for you ;-)</td>', 'Nice, fits the challenge well.Looks as though you had to twist his arm to sit for you ;-)', '2004-08-25 10:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(876368, 99824, 5354, '<td valign="top">Can''t make the connection with hope at all - you will have to explain this to me after the challenge ends.</td>', 'Can''t make the connection with hope at all - you will have to explain this to me after the challenge ends.', '2004-08-25 10:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(876369, 98983, 15204, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  Good composition.  The b&amp;w is done perfectly here, to my eye.  I like the way the chain link shows up in the foreground against the black part of the background, but somehow it gets a little confusing and distracting on the left side of the picture.  I am not sure how you could have done it differently, though.    9 from me.</td>', 'Great capture.  Good composition.  The b&w is done perfectly here, to my eye.  I like the way the chain link shows up in the foreground against the black part of the background, but somehow it gets a little confusing and distracting on the left side of the picture.  I am not sure how you could have done it differently, though.    9 from me.', '2004-08-25 10:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(876372, 98879, 5354, '<td valign="top">No idea what they are, but the image is very nice. There must be a connection between ''livestrong'' and hope, but its not clear to me, though I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt.</td>', 'No idea what they are, but the image is very nice. There must be a connection between ''livestrong'' and hope, but its not clear to me, though I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt.', '2004-08-25 10:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(876375, 99896, 5354, '<td valign="top">Hope you can explain how this links to ''HOPE'' - I''m struggling</td>', 'Hope you can explain how this links to ''HOPE'' - I''m struggling', '2004-08-25 10:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(876378, 99935, 25309, '<td valign="top">It would have been a nice photo if the foot print were going the other side of the camera eye...</td>', 'It would have been a nice photo if the foot print were going the other side of the camera eye...', '2004-08-25 10:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(876379, 99351, 25309, '<td valign="top">It looks more like he/she is scared?</td>', 'It looks more like he/she is scared?', '2004-08-25 10:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(876382, 99676, 5354, '<td valign="top">Nice enough sunset, but I think thats not enough in this challenge. The winners will have an additional ''something'' which goes beyond the literal.<br/> <br/>As a landscape its very nice, though the singlr spot of light in the bottom centre and the red dot on a pole are distracting</td>', 'Nice enough sunset, but I think thats not enough in this challenge. The winners will have an additional ''something'' which goes beyond the literal. As a landscape its very nice, though the singlr spot of light in the bottom centre and the red dot on a pole are distracting', '2004-08-25 10:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(876384, 99783, 14603, '<td valign="top">The "feel" of the image could cover a variety of themes as it doesn`t really shout out anything in particular. However, there is no denying the impact and vibrancy of the post processing...particularly impressive given the limitations of the challenge.<br/>Excellent work and with enough linkage to "Hope" to make it successful...9</td>', 'The "feel" of the image could cover a variety of themes as it doesn`t really shout out anything in particular. However, there is no denying the impact and vibrancy of the post processing...particularly impressive given the limitations of the challenge.Excellent work and with enough linkage to "Hope" to make it successful...9', '2004-08-25 10:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(876385, 99605, 5354, '<td valign="top">The title tells me that the bloom is the main focal point, however the image shouts ''HAND - LOOK AT ME NOT THE FLOWERS''. I find this very difficult to score.</td>', 'The title tells me that the bloom is the main focal point, however the image shouts ''HAND - LOOK AT ME NOT THE FLOWERS''. I find this very difficult to score.', '2004-08-25 10:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(876389, 99825, 5354, '<td valign="top">I know the title tells me there is no sunlight, but this is dull in the extreme, though the composition just about saves the image from being a discard. It won''t ribbon though will it ?</td>', 'I know the title tells me there is no sunlight, but this is dull in the extreme, though the composition just about saves the image from being a discard. It won''t ribbon though will it ?', '2004-08-25 10:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(876391, 99090, 14603, '<td valign="top">Powerful image..well composed and exposed.</td>', 'Powerful image..well composed and exposed.', '2004-08-25 10:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(876393, 99771, 5354, '<td valign="top">So why did you not trya and compose the sign into the image with a little more thought. With a little more creativity this could have been so much better. As it is its a simple sign with a faint thread of humour.</td>', 'So why did you not trya and compose the sign into the image with a little more thought. With a little more creativity this could have been so much better. As it is its a simple sign with a faint thread of humour.', '2004-08-25 10:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(876395, 98528, 14603, '<td valign="top">Nicely on theme for the challenge..also love the exposure and composition.<br/>Should do well.<br/>Good luck</td>', 'Nicely on theme for the challenge..also love the exposure and composition.Should do well.Good luck', '2004-08-25 10:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(876396, 99416, 24925, '<td valign="top">Nice...the pattern on her shirt keeps distracting me from the important things (her face, the flowers/petals, her hair)...Different shirt would have earned this a 7...<br/> <br/>Good work!</td>', 'Nice...the pattern on her shirt keeps distracting me from the important things (her face, the flowers/petals, her hair)...Different shirt would have earned this a 7... Good work!', '2004-08-25 10:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(876398, 99103, 24925, '<td valign="top">Great pic, wrong challenge!</td>', 'Great pic, wrong challenge!', '2004-08-25 10:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(876400, 99342, 24925, '<td valign="top">Cute...hopefully I get time to comment a little more later...</td>', 'Cute...hopefully I get time to comment a little more later...', '2004-08-25 10:23:10.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(876403, 99670, 14603, '<td valign="top">The eyes say it all !!!<br/>Very good exposure and pin sharp.<br/>Good work</td>', 'The eyes say it all !!!Very good exposure and pin sharp.Good work', '2004-08-25 10:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(876404, 99674, 5354, '<td valign="top">A very dark image - needs some light</td>', 'A very dark image - needs some light', '2004-08-25 10:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(876408, 99509, 5354, '<td valign="top">To me this is the opposite of hope, but a nice image all the same</td>', 'To me this is the opposite of hope, but a nice image all the same', '2004-08-25 10:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(876411, 99787, 24925, '<td valign="top">I hope to comment on this later...quick version:<br/> <br/>Focus is too soft for my taste<br/>Composition seems unplanned (stick in middle at top, reflection of subject is cut off)<br/>I don''t really see hope in this picture.</td>', 'I hope to comment on this later...quick version: Focus is too soft for my tasteComposition seems unplanned (stick in middle at top, reflection of subject is cut off)I don''t really see hope in this picture.', '2004-08-25 10:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(876412, 99936, 25309, '<td valign="top">could have been nice with more focus.</td>', 'could have been nice with more focus.', '2004-08-25 10:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(876413, 98670, 24925, '<td valign="top">What happened to hope?</td>', 'What happened to hope?', '2004-08-25 10:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(876416, 98780, 14603, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot (Iceland v Italy?).<br/>Given that the light is fading, you have done well to stop the action and keep a reasonable DOF.<br/>Nicely captured.</td>', 'Nice action shot (Iceland v Italy?).Given that the light is fading, you have done well to stop the action and keep a reasonable DOF.Nicely captured.', '2004-08-25 10:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(876417, 99403, 24951, '<td valign="top">This is a fine idea. I like this, a little too dark above the daisy. Needs a little more contrast pehaps?</td>', 'This is a fine idea. I like this, a little too dark above the daisy. Needs a little more contrast pehaps?', '2004-08-25 10:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(876419, 99875, 4226, '<td valign="top">You could have taken a little different angle and cropped a little not to show the whole light setup.. if you wanted to show ''light'' as hope,  then only  some rays could have worked</td>', 'You could have taken a little different angle and cropped a little not to show the whole light setup.. if you wanted to show ''light'' as hope,  then only  some rays could have worked', '2004-08-25 10:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(876422, 99918, 4226, '<td valign="top">dramatic lighting and good use of mirrors</td>', 'dramatic lighting and good use of mirrors', '2004-08-25 10:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(876423, 98917, 24951, '<td valign="top">Too dark for me. I can''t really make out what it is. Sorry</td>', 'Too dark for me. I can''t really make out what it is. Sorry', '2004-08-25 10:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(876424, 99742, 19841, '<td valign="top">You have a dramatic subject, and an iconic composition, but the flash attached to the camera gave you flat lighting.  This exact same shot with available lighting would have been much better.</td>', 'You have a dramatic subject, and an iconic composition, but the flash attached to the camera gave you flat lighting.  This exact same shot with available lighting would have been much better.', '2004-08-25 10:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(876426, 99830, 25309, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, photo is neat. But I don''t see hope! I see more Joy, Love, etc. She seems to have what she wants.. Anyway, at least its not a baby, or a church, or a sky... like 90% of the other photos. an 8 for the quality of image</td>', 'Nice colors, photo is neat. But I don''t see hope! I see more Joy, Love, etc. She seems to have what she wants.. Anyway, at least its not a baby, or a church, or a sky... like 90% of the other photos. an 8 for the quality of image', '2004-08-25 10:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(876428, 99674, 4226, '<td valign="top">nice image. I would personally feel better if the tree had lesser no. of leaves...and it still had a hope to survive...</td>', 'nice image. I would personally feel better if the tree had lesser no. of leaves...and it still had a hope to survive...', '2004-08-25 10:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(876429, 98576, 14603, '<td valign="top">Great exposure and lighting, you have made good use of the negative space to balance your composition.<br/>Very fitting for the challenge..should do well,<br/>Good luck</td>', 'Great exposure and lighting, you have made good use of the negative space to balance your composition.Very fitting for the challenge..should do well,Good luck', '2004-08-25 10:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(876430, 98616, 5354, '<td valign="top">Pushing hope into the negative is maybe going to get some negative marks, but not from me. I like this very much</td>', 'Pushing hope into the negative is maybe going to get some negative marks, but not from me. I like this very much', '2004-08-25 10:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(876433, 99666, 5354, '<td valign="top">Too much like a snapshot, distracting background, bits of other cars just in frame, compositionally very weak</td>', 'Too much like a snapshot, distracting background, bits of other cars just in frame, compositionally very weak', '2004-08-25 10:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(876434, 99866, 5354, '<td valign="top">Needs lighting to make this image work, to dull at the moment</td>', 'Needs lighting to make this image work, to dull at the moment', '2004-08-25 10:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(876435, 99931, 5354, '<td valign="top">struggling to find a link to hope. Yes I understand that hoping to survive has a link, but its pushing it a bit.</td>', 'struggling to find a link to hope. Yes I understand that hoping to survive has a link, but its pushing it a bit.', '2004-08-25 10:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(876437, 98946, 24925, '<td valign="top">Okay, finally a picture that deserves more than a 4!  More comments to follow if time allows...7</td>', 'Okay, finally a picture that deserves more than a 4!  More comments to follow if time allows...7', '2004-08-25 10:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(876438, 99791, 5354, '<td valign="top">Hope may well be in a mosque, but thats a different argument.<br/>Nice image, great lines and composition.</td>', 'Hope may well be in a mosque, but thats a different argument.Nice image, great lines and composition.', '2004-08-25 10:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(876440, 99334, 5354, '<td valign="top">Why so dull - needs light</td>', 'Why so dull - needs light', '2004-08-25 10:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(876444, 99797, 5354, '<td valign="top">meets the challenge, but isn''t very inspiring is it</td>', 'meets the challenge, but isn''t very inspiring is it', '2004-08-25 10:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(876447, 99777, 5354, '<td valign="top">I find the lighting difference between the hands and the sky very disturbing</td>', 'I find the lighting difference between the hands and the sky very disturbing', '2004-08-25 10:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(876451, 99397, 5354, '<td valign="top">just crop the dark line off the top to make this really special</td>', 'just crop the dark line off the top to make this really special', '2004-08-25 10:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(876457, 98576, 19978, '<td valign="top">An extremely compelling, all-around well-done shot. The negative space and black background are wonderful. The mood and emotion are very powerful. Outstanding!</td>', 'An extremely compelling, all-around well-done shot. The negative space and black background are wonderful. The mood and emotion are very powerful. Outstanding!', '2004-08-25 10:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(876464, 98701, 19978, '<td valign="top">A wonderful portrait. The two girls are just beautiful and the expression on the faces is priceless. I might have tried a tighter crop to give the overall photo more of a portrait feel and filled the frame side to side with the two faces and kitten below. Very nice!</td>', 'A wonderful portrait. The two girls are just beautiful and the expression on the faces is priceless. I might have tried a tighter crop to give the overall photo more of a portrait feel and filled the frame side to side with the two faces and kitten below. Very nice!', '2004-08-25 10:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(876466, 99893, 19978, '<td valign="top">Oh c''mon, there''s still at least two millimeters between the two sets of lips! Kiss it! Nicely executed concept shot. Very well done!</td>', 'Oh c''mon, there''s still at least two millimeters between the two sets of lips! Kiss it! Nicely executed concept shot. Very well done!', '2004-08-25 10:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(876467, 99721, 22094, '<td valign="top">this is great but it looks a bit too white overall, otherwise good</td>', 'this is great but it looks a bit too white overall, otherwise good', '2004-08-25 10:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(876468, 99744, 19978, '<td valign="top">An excellent portrait. The mood is powerfully felt. I''d like to see a more de-centered composition though, possibly with more negative space to the left, where she''s looking.</td>', 'An excellent portrait. The mood is powerfully felt. I''d like to see a more de-centered composition though, possibly with more negative space to the left, where she''s looking.', '2004-08-25 10:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(876472, 99666, 10208, '<td valign="top">Nice car,</td>', 'Nice car,', '2004-08-25 10:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(876480, 99521, 25724, '<td valign="top">si señor kaske  muy elegante, sin saber que era la tuya me gusto cuando las vi,mucha calidad para ser novato jejejejejejeeje</td>', 'si señor kaske  muy elegante, sin saber que era la tuya me gusto cuando las vi,mucha calidad para ser novato jejejejejejeeje', '2004-08-25 11:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
