(876887, 99923, 6845, '<td valign="top">I just got to know. Is this image upside down? It really looks like it is. And I am sad to say that it bugs me enough to vote down a little. I really like the composition and the tonal range is really good. If it is upside down I am not sure why. I turned it over and it looks fine the other way. But please don''t think I was too harsh in the voting, I still gave it a 9.</td>', 'I just got to know. Is this image upside down? It really looks like it is. And I am sad to say that it bugs me enough to vote down a little. I really like the composition and the tonal range is really good. If it is upside down I am not sure why. I turned it over and it looks fine the other way. But please don''t think I was too harsh in the voting, I still gave it a 9.', '2004-08-25 14:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(876888, 99549, 20115, '<td valign="top">Great idea for the challenge--so far I have not seen too many photos that are really hopeful without the title conveying what the photographer wanted us to feel.  I do however feel that the overall photo is a little dark.  Some of the levels should have been brought up a bit.</td>', 'Great idea for the challenge--so far I have not seen too many photos that are really hopeful without the title conveying what the photographer wanted us to feel.  I do however feel that the overall photo is a little dark.  Some of the levels should have been brought up a bit.', '2004-08-25 14:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(876892, 99606, 18197, '<td valign="top">If your camera will allow it, making the image bigger would help. I''d like to see more of the detail here.</td>', 'If your camera will allow it, making the image bigger would help. I''d like to see more of the detail here.', '2004-08-25 14:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(876894, 99478, 20115, '<td valign="top">I love the clouds, but the rest of the shot is a little to dark for me.</td>', 'I love the clouds, but the rest of the shot is a little to dark for me.', '2004-08-25 14:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(876898, 99734, 18197, '<td valign="top">If your camera will allow it, making this bigger would help.</td>', 'If your camera will allow it, making this bigger would help.', '2004-08-25 14:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(876899, 99507, 20115, '<td valign="top">Get those powerlines out and this would be a great photo.</td>', 'Get those powerlines out and this would be a great photo.', '2004-08-25 14:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(876905, 99403, 18197, '<td valign="top">I hope it''s just my monitor, but the dark chains are so dark I can see little detail. I think if I could see them better I could have given a higher score.</td>', 'I hope it''s just my monitor, but the dark chains are so dark I can see little detail. I think if I could see them better I could have given a higher score.', '2004-08-25 14:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(876907, 98820, 13759, '<td valign="top">Hope isn´t waiting! :)</td>', 'Hope isn´t waiting! :)', '2004-08-25 14:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(876911, 98616, 23614, '<td valign="top">Nice lightning!</td>', 'Nice lightning!', '2004-08-25 14:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(876914, 99918, 24169, '<td valign="top">Very interesting picture and nice use of mirrors. I like the lighting and also the background is good.</td>', 'Very interesting picture and nice use of mirrors. I like the lighting and also the background is good.', '2004-08-25 14:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(876917, 99829, 24169, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept.</td>', 'Interesting concept.', '2004-08-25 14:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(876918, 99691, 18197, '<td valign="top">I hope it''s just my monitor but this is pretty dark. I can see the red background, the silhouette of the bottle and the the Absolut Vodka words but little else. From what I can see, it could be a pretty dramatic image but I can see so little I don''t see the tie in to hope.</td>', 'I hope it''s just my monitor but this is pretty dark. I can see the red background, the silhouette of the bottle and the the Absolut Vodka words but little else. From what I can see, it could be a pretty dramatic image but I can see so little I don''t see the tie in to hope.', '2004-08-25 14:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(876920, 99773, 24169, '<td valign="top">A different take on the challenge which I like. Maybe if the butt of the gun had also been in the picture it may have had better composition.</td>', 'A different take on the challenge which I like. Maybe if the butt of the gun had also been in the picture it may have had better composition.', '2004-08-25 14:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(876925, 99818, 25189, '<td valign="top">Very sharp capture.  I think the background would be less distracting of it was blurred more with a larger aperture.</td>', 'Very sharp capture.  I think the background would be less distracting of it was blurred more with a larger aperture.', '2004-08-25 14:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(876926, 99898, 25189, '<td valign="top">awww... cute!  The contrast from overexposed water to underexposed faces and woods is a tad distracting.  Perhaps it would be less of a problem if the subjects were a few feet closer to the camera in the sunlight.</td>', 'awww... cute!  The contrast from overexposed water to underexposed faces and woods is a tad distracting.  Perhaps it would be less of a problem if the subjects were a few feet closer to the camera in the sunlight.', '2004-08-25 14:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(876927, 99370, 24169, '<td valign="top">Have you used a program like neat image? Nice DOF though and great colours.</td>', 'Have you used a program like neat image? Nice DOF though and great colours.', '2004-08-25 14:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(876932, 99058, 24169, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition. The veil especiaqlly looks nice being swept away like that. Could have moved the people slightly to the left though as the break in the foliage is distracting.</td>', 'Lovely composition. The veil especiaqlly looks nice being swept away like that. Could have moved the people slightly to the left though as the break in the foliage is distracting.', '2004-08-25 14:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(876933, 99482, 23614, '<td valign="top">Very interesting. Horizon could have been a little more leveled. Good job.</td>', 'Very interesting. Horizon could have been a little more leveled. Good job.', '2004-08-25 14:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(876936, 98599, 23614, '<td valign="top">Nice picture and good idea. Meets the challenge perfectly. I don''t like the title all that much though. Good job.</td>', 'Nice picture and good idea. Meets the challenge perfectly. I don''t like the title all that much though. Good job.', '2004-08-25 14:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(876937, 99062, 24169, '<td valign="top">Nice photo and personally I like the DOF. Nice neutral colours throughout.</td>', 'Nice photo and personally I like the DOF. Nice neutral colours throughout.', '2004-08-25 14:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(876940, 99799, 24169, '<td valign="top">The branches in the foreground seem a little distracting - maybe it is the one that is in the front of the subject. Nice colours though - very vibrant.</td>', 'The branches in the foreground seem a little distracting - maybe it is the one that is in the front of the subject. Nice colours though - very vibrant.', '2004-08-25 14:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(876941, 99762, 23614, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection. What about if you cropped and brought the horizon at 1/3 of the top and removing the moon that''s a bit blurry because of long exposure?</td>', 'Nice reflection. What about if you cropped and brought the horizon at 1/3 of the top and removing the moon that''s a bit blurry because of long exposure?', '2004-08-25 14:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(876942, 99896, 24169, '<td valign="top">Very different and quite creative. How did you come up with the idea?</td>', 'Very different and quite creative. How did you come up with the idea?', '2004-08-25 14:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(876944, 99923, 25426, '<td valign="top">Very creative idea and nice execution too.</td>', 'Very creative idea and nice execution too.', '2004-08-25 14:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(876945, 99908, 18197, '<td valign="top">Bumped your score up a point for your sense of humor!</td>', 'Bumped your score up a point for your sense of humor!', '2004-08-25 14:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(876946, 99473, 23614, '<td valign="top">Nice macro shot. It''s pretty sharp and funny!</td>', 'Nice macro shot. It''s pretty sharp and funny!', '2004-08-25 14:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(876947, 99915, 24169, '<td valign="top">A little too bright on the card - could have made the writing clearer. Also seems to be a little off in composition.</td>', 'A little too bright on the card - could have made the writing clearer. Also seems to be a little off in composition.', '2004-08-25 14:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(876949, 99367, 24413, '<td valign="top">Was this purposely submitted on it''s side?  I think it would have been better vertical.</td>', 'Was this purposely submitted on it''s side?  I think it would have been better vertical.', '2004-08-25 14:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(876951, 98989, 24169, '<td valign="top">DOF seems off as the focus is soft around most of the photo.</td>', 'DOF seems off as the focus is soft around most of the photo.', '2004-08-25 14:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(876952, 99781, 10124, '<td valign="top">very dramatic. i like it. highlights are a little blown out.</td>', 'very dramatic. i like it. highlights are a little blown out.', '2004-08-25 14:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(876953, 99923, 23614, '<td valign="top">The texture of the wood gives a lot to the picture. It''s also nice to see this in black and white. One of my favorites</td>', 'The texture of the wood gives a lot to the picture. It''s also nice to see this in black and white. One of my favorites', '2004-08-25 14:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
