(877088, 99416, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very nice job. Among the best of this challenge. Subject, focus, colors are all virtually perfect. They do a nice job of conveying an emotional punch.</td>', 'Very nice job. Among the best of this challenge. Subject, focus, colors are all virtually perfect. They do a nice job of conveying an emotional punch.', '2004-08-25 15:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
