(877094, 98759, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very nice sunset. Unlike a lot of shots in this challenge, this photo has a lot of interest. The usual clouds draw my attention and create a sense of motion which contrasts nicely (both in color and sharpness) with the silhouetted ground. this is among my top picks.</td>', 'Very nice sunset. Unlike a lot of shots in this challenge, this photo has a lot of interest. The usual clouds draw my attention and create a sense of motion which contrasts nicely (both in color and sharpness) with the silhouetted ground. this is among my top picks.', '2004-08-25 15:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
