(877105, 99344, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very risky photo in this forum. <br/> <br/>I like the composition, colors, levels and DOF. Clearly there is a terrific emotional kick, and point of view here. Very well done. This is among my top picks for this challenge.</td>', 'Very risky photo in this forum.  I like the composition, colors, levels and DOF. Clearly there is a terrific emotional kick, and point of view here. Very well done. This is among my top picks for this challenge.', '2004-08-25 15:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(877109, 99089, 18197, '<td valign="top">Simply outstanding!<br/> <br/>Very strong composition. Subject matter has plenty of punch. Colors and levels are good. Focus could be a little sharper. And if your camera can handle it, a larger image would have been even more effective.<br/> <br/>Among my top picks for this challenge.</td>', 'Simply outstanding! Very strong composition. Subject matter has plenty of punch. Colors and levels are good. Focus could be a little sharper. And if your camera can handle it, a larger image would have been even more effective. Among my top picks for this challenge.', '2004-08-25 15:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
