(877438, 99090, 19978, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo. It''s amazing what can be expressed by viewing part of one eye. It''s amazing that you had the vision to "see" this and then make it happen in your composition. Striking and powerful.</td>', 'Beautiful photo. It''s amazing what can be expressed by viewing part of one eye. It''s amazing that you had the vision to "see" this and then make it happen in your composition. Striking and powerful.', '2004-08-25 18:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(877446, 98749, 5354, '<td valign="top">ok - this is going to sound really negative, but I hope what I have to say will be taken in a constructive manner.<br/> <br/>This image has the feel of a snap. the lighting is ... well frankly attrocious, there are unfortunate shadows behind the dog. <br/> <br/>The fork is washed out in the highlights and feels out of focus.<br/> <br/>The diagonal line of the table edge really just cuts the image in half for no good effect.<br/> <br/>On the bright side theres a hell of a lot to improve on here, you really can learn a lot from analysing the negatives.</td>', 'ok - this is going to sound really negative, but I hope what I have to say will be taken in a constructive manner. This image has the feel of a snap. the lighting is ... well frankly attrocious, there are unfortunate shadows behind the dog.  The fork is washed out in the highlights and feels out of focus. The diagonal line of the table edge really just cuts the image in half for no good effect. On the bright side theres a hell of a lot to improve on here, you really can learn a lot from analysing the negatives.', '2004-08-25 18:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(877452, 99774, 25890, '<td valign="top">Allusion to "Indiana Jones and The Last Crusade"? Kinda cute actually. But then, it''s somewhat difficult for me to see that the person in the picture is taking a huge risk hoping to achieve something important. Different angle, composition and lighting might have given me a sense of "no risk, no glory" and "hope for the best" more effectively. Good effort nevertheless.</td>', 'Allusion to "Indiana Jones and The Last Crusade"? Kinda cute actually. But then, it''s somewhat difficult for me to see that the person in the picture is taking a huge risk hoping to achieve something important. Different angle, composition and lighting might have given me a sense of "no risk, no glory" and "hope for the best" more effectively. Good effort nevertheless.', '2004-08-25 18:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(877453, 99683, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love this picture.   It''s beautiful.  The way the girl is looking "hopefully" towards the boy really conveys the sentiment.   Great job!</td>', 'I love this picture.   It''s beautiful.  The way the girl is looking "hopefully" towards the boy really conveys the sentiment.   Great job!', '2004-08-25 18:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(877454, 99060, 25890, '<td valign="top">Apart from the fact that I personally do not find most insects aesthetically appealing, this fella appears more to be singing an aria at the top of its lungs under a spotlight than to be struggling/hoping to be free. But still, creative thinking and set-up.</td>', 'Apart from the fact that I personally do not find most insects aesthetically appealing, this fella appears more to be singing an aria at the top of its lungs under a spotlight than to be struggling/hoping to be free. But still, creative thinking and set-up.', '2004-08-25 18:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
