(877515, 99333, 24065, '<td valign="top">And a precious angel, she is.  Just my opinion -- others may disagree -- but I would have lliked this more if it had been a closer shot -- perhaps from the elbows up -- with very little background.  I''ve also read that b&amp;w works well with "emotional" shots -- I think that might work here.</td>', 'And a precious angel, she is.  Just my opinion -- others may disagree -- but I would have lliked this more if it had been a closer shot -- perhaps from the elbows up -- with very little background.  I''ve also read that b&w works well with "emotional" shots -- I think that might work here.', '2004-08-25 19:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(877517, 99676, 24065, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors</td>', 'beautiful colors', '2004-08-25 19:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(877528, 99935, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I like the dark moody sky and sea. The reflection of the rock is fantastic. The hand-scralled "hope" in the fore ground could have been cheesy, but in this case it works very well. I suspect the water will obliterate it soon, but in fact, that''s is one of the emotional strengths of the photo. Hope is a transient for most people. Maybe my monitor is too dark, but if I were editing this, I might have brightened it just a bit. Still among my top 10 picks this time.</td>', 'Nice shot. I like the dark moody sky and sea. The reflection of the rock is fantastic. The hand-scralled "hope" in the fore ground could have been cheesy, but in this case it works very well. I suspect the water will obliterate it soon, but in fact, that''s is one of the emotional strengths of the photo. Hope is a transient for most people. Maybe my monitor is too dark, but if I were editing this, I might have brightened it just a bit. Still among my top 10 picks this time.', '2004-08-25 19:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(877533, 99725, 6130, '<td valign="top">Great 10</td>', 'Great 10', '2004-08-25 19:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(877535, 99783, 19982, '<td valign="top">Wow, love the image...  I know you''ll hate me for this, but I just have a hard time fitting the title to the image, otherwise I would score this one really high.</td>', 'Wow, love the image...  I know you''ll hate me for this, but I just have a hard time fitting the title to the image, otherwise I would score this one really high.', '2004-08-25 19:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(877542, 99416, 21714, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image. Beautiful creation. Well done.</td>', 'Wonderful image. Beautiful creation. Well done.', '2004-08-25 19:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(877543, 99631, 21714, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Brilliant!</td>', 'Nicely done. Brilliant!', '2004-08-25 19:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(877546, 98908, 21714, '<td valign="top">Not too sure about the concept, but I can see how you have used the fishing boat and the fisherman.  Love the grain &amp; colours.</td>', 'Not too sure about the concept, but I can see how you have used the fishing boat and the fisherman.  Love the grain & colours.', '2004-08-25 20:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(877549, 99071, 21714, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Love the tonality &amp; composition.</td>', 'Nicely done. Love the tonality & composition.', '2004-08-25 20:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(877553, 99472, 21714, '<td valign="top">Great B&amp;W. Looks a wee bit over sharpened. Brilliant concept. Well done.</td>', 'Great B&W. Looks a wee bit over sharpened. Brilliant concept. Well done.', '2004-08-25 20:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(877558, 98599, 12674, '<td valign="top">Just pull your pants up a little bit and you''ll be fine...fun shot.</td>', 'Just pull your pants up a little bit and you''ll be fine...fun shot.', '2004-08-25 20:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(877562, 99423, 12674, '<td valign="top">Brighter lighting would make it easier to focus and steady your shot.</td>', 'Brighter lighting would make it easier to focus and steady your shot.', '2004-08-25 20:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(877580, 99192, 25787, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture</td>', 'Beautiful picture', '2004-08-25 20:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(877582, 98528, 25787, '<td valign="top">great picture</td>', 'great picture', '2004-08-25 20:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(877584, 98820, 12674, '<td valign="top">I see someone with a red bucket on the other side....</td>', 'I see someone with a red bucket on the other side....', '2004-08-25 20:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(877586, 98551, 12674, '<td valign="top">Great shot....but it doesn''t portray hope.</td>', 'Great shot....but it doesn''t portray hope.', '2004-08-25 20:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(877587, 99705, 12573, '<td valign="top">Ribbon winner.  Blue.  By far.  I have nothing else to say.</td>', 'Ribbon winner.  Blue.  By far.  I have nothing else to say.', '2004-08-25 20:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(877590, 99909, 12674, '<td valign="top">Great idea...I almost did something similar...automatic 10!</td>', 'Great idea...I almost did something similar...automatic 10!', '2004-08-25 20:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(877592, 99694, 24546, '<td valign="top">This is a diffiult shot to do well - you have your bright sunlit areas (which are overexposed here bringing a loss of detail to the grasses beside the trail) and your shadow areas.  The use of a neutral density graduated filter helps to even out the exposure.  Also taking photos after the sun has moved behind the mountain or on a cloudy day can even out the exposure also.  If you are planning to use photoshop gradient filters - expose for the brightest areas and then use shadow reduction  or a gradient layer to bring out the details in the shadows. (I''m not sure what the rules are here about gradient layers  and shadow reduction- an ND gradient filter at time of taking the shot is definitely legal.)  Good luck!</td>', 'This is a diffiult shot to do well - you have your bright sunlit areas (which are overexposed here bringing a loss of detail to the grasses beside the trail) and your shadow areas.  The use of a neutral density graduated filter helps to even out the exposure.  Also taking photos after the sun has moved behind the mountain or on a cloudy day can even out the exposure also.  If you are planning to use photoshop gradient filters - expose for the brightest areas and then use shadow reduction  or a gradient layer to bring out the details in the shadows. (I''m not sure what the rules are here about gradient layers  and shadow reduction- an ND gradient filter at time of taking the shot is definitely legal.)  Good luck!', '2004-08-25 20:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(877594, 99071, 25464, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo.  Meets the challenge.  Nice pose.  Great expressions.  My only suggestion would be to take a look at it cropped closer on the right.  I think that would make the baby''s expression central rather than the baby as a whole the central focus. 8.</td>', 'Lovely photo.  Meets the challenge.  Nice pose.  Great expressions.  My only suggestion would be to take a look at it cropped closer on the right.  I think that would make the baby''s expression central rather than the baby as a whole the central focus. 8.', '2004-08-25 20:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(877595, 99683, 12573, '<td valign="top">Oh, this is so close to being so much better that I have to comment.  Moving the boy a little closer to her and getting the top of his head out of the trees would do wonders for this shot.  Also, turning her head more torward him so that we can clearly see that she is looking at him would improve the feeling of hope.  It''s a great idea and I really hope you reshoot it with just some minor changes.  I love it.</td>', 'Oh, this is so close to being so much better that I have to comment.  Moving the boy a little closer to her and getting the top of his head out of the trees would do wonders for this shot.  Also, turning her head more torward him so that we can clearly see that she is looking at him would improve the feeling of hope.  It''s a great idea and I really hope you reshoot it with just some minor changes.  I love it.', '2004-08-25 20:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(877599, 99759, 12674, '<td valign="top">Who''s Robert and what''s he hoping for?  Sorry, don''t get connection.</td>', 'Who''s Robert and what''s he hoping for?  Sorry, don''t get connection.', '2004-08-25 20:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(877602, 99869, 25464, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  The only thing I see that is a bit distracting is the hair across her nose. Pose is beautiful.  Lighting is perfect. 7.</td>', 'Very nice.  The only thing I see that is a bit distracting is the hair across her nose. Pose is beautiful.  Lighting is perfect. 7.', '2004-08-25 20:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(877603, 99909, 12573, '<td valign="top">Don''t agree with the message, but it reflects a certain sentiment pretty well.  My eye is drawn to the sky in the upper left, which is highly exposed.  I understand that it would have been difficult to capture, but the same scene without the vehicles below would be an improvement in my opinion.  Overall, good effort though. 6</td>', 'Don''t agree with the message, but it reflects a certain sentiment pretty well.  My eye is drawn to the sky in the upper left, which is highly exposed.  I understand that it would have been difficult to capture, but the same scene without the vehicles below would be an improvement in my opinion.  Overall, good effort though. 6', '2004-08-25 20:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(877607, 99679, 12573, '<td valign="top">Cute composition with lots of energy.  Her hands look a bit posed, but the facial expression is great.  I love how she''s looking at the viewer (me) as though begging for help.  I wonder if getting closer to the victim and using some shallow DOF to separate the plucker from the pluckee would benefit the image.</td>', 'Cute composition with lots of energy.  Her hands look a bit posed, but the facial expression is great.  I love how she''s looking at the viewer (me) as though begging for help.  I wonder if getting closer to the victim and using some shallow DOF to separate the plucker from the pluckee would benefit the image.', '2004-08-25 20:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(877609, 99931, 12674, '<td valign="top">Nice picture...but it ain''t hope.</td>', 'Nice picture...but it ain''t hope.', '2004-08-25 20:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(877610, 99696, 12573, '<td valign="top">Well, bummer.  I can'' t tell who the guy is or what the guy is doing.  I imagine he''s a carpenter, looking at his newest project.  I dunno.  I just feel too removed from the subject to be interested.</td>', 'Well, bummer.  I can'' t tell who the guy is or what the guy is doing.  I imagine he''s a carpenter, looking at his newest project.  I dunno.  I just feel too removed from the subject to be interested.', '2004-08-25 20:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(877612, 99871, 12573, '<td valign="top">Shouldn''t they have rally caps on?  If we''re to believe they''re really hoping for something, I want to see more tension...more anxiety...more leaning on each other for support.  It just looks like any normal at bat in any normal game.</td>', 'Shouldn''t they have rally caps on?  If we''re to believe they''re really hoping for something, I want to see more tension...more anxiety...more leaning on each other for support.  It just looks like any normal at bat in any normal game.', '2004-08-25 20:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(877614, 99273, 12674, '<td valign="top">Hope?</td>', 'Hope?', '2004-08-25 20:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(877615, 99033, 4226, '<td valign="top">IMO you can improve the picture by giving more space on the top.. that is your hand should only  occupyt the corner part and may be upto maximum of 40% in the height of the total photo.<br/>You can try changing the canvas size with background as black and see the effect.<br/></td>', 'IMO you can improve the picture by giving more space on the top.. that is your hand should only  occupyt the corner part and may be upto maximum of 40% in the height of the total photo.You can try changing the canvas size with background as black and see the effect.', '2004-08-25 20:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(877619, 99376, 4226, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. The ship seems to go out of the frame here. IMO it might look better if the ship is going into the frame instead.  <br/>Pretty wonderful clouds out there</td>', 'Nice capture. The ship seems to go out of the frame here. IMO it might look better if the ship is going into the frame instead.  Pretty wonderful clouds out there', '2004-08-25 20:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(877621, 99696, 18197, '<td valign="top">This is very good in spite of the title. It is among my top 10 mostly because of the strong composition and outstanding levels. Color, focus, DOF and so on are each good enough, but when combined, strengthen the picture. IMO it would be better w/o the border, but that''s a matter of personal preference I think.</td>', 'This is very good in spite of the title. It is among my top 10 mostly because of the strong composition and outstanding levels. Color, focus, DOF and so on are each good enough, but when combined, strengthen the picture. IMO it would be better w/o the border, but that''s a matter of personal preference I think.', '2004-08-25 20:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(877627, 99936, 4226, '<td valign="top">I like the shot.  I think you can improve upon the contrast a bit by using channel mixer and then you might be able to bring out the flower off your hands.. just a thought</td>', 'I like the shot.  I think you can improve upon the contrast a bit by using channel mixer and then you might be able to bring out the flower off your hands.. just a thought', '2004-08-25 21:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(877629, 99666, 12573, '<td valign="top">Nice effort.  I wonder, though, how well it really fits the challenge.  Given your title, I''d love to see the owner of the car next to it with a worried expression, holding his hand out like it''s starting to drizzle.  As it is, it seems to be just a snapshot of a ''33-34 Ford 5-window coupe (and a lovely one at that) at a car show.</td>', 'Nice effort.  I wonder, though, how well it really fits the challenge.  Given your title, I''d love to see the owner of the car next to it with a worried expression, holding his hand out like it''s starting to drizzle.  As it is, it seems to be just a snapshot of a ''33-34 Ford 5-window coupe (and a lovely one at that) at a car show.', '2004-08-25 21:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(877634, 99351, 12573, '<td valign="top">In the context of DPC, this does indeed hit home as an image of hope.  Outside of DPC, well, it''s a little obscure.  We can tell it''s a computer monitor, but we''re not sure who "they" are and "what" they''re supposed to like.  It''s not a bad image though and I''m giving you a 6 because I like the mood created (even though I don''t think most people would agree that mood to be hope).</td>', 'In the context of DPC, this does indeed hit home as an image of hope.  Outside of DPC, well, it''s a little obscure.  We can tell it''s a computer monitor, but we''re not sure who "they" are and "what" they''re supposed to like.  It''s not a bad image though and I''m giving you a 6 because I like the mood created (even though I don''t think most people would agree that mood to be hope).', '2004-08-25 21:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(877645, 99931, 22411, '<td valign="top">what sort of bird is this?</td>', 'what sort of bird is this?', '2004-08-25 21:13:24.000000', NULL, 1);
