(877827, 99764, 25464, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  Very nice photo.  It seems a little out of focus around the beak.  The focus seems to be on the blade of grass across the chest instead.  Overall very nice. 7.</td>', 'Great idea.  Very nice photo.  It seems a little out of focus around the beak.  The focus seems to be on the blade of grass across the chest instead.  Overall very nice. 7.', '2004-08-25 22:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
