(877863, 98921, 19978, '<td valign="top">Quite apart from the requirements of the challenge, this is a wonderful photograph, one that I wish I had the imagination and the opportunity to capture. The golden light, the tones of the sky and the ground, the lights in the distance. Amazing work. Now, how does it meet the challenge? I''m frankly not sure I see your point in the title. The lone person walking in the distance adds an element of loneliness to the picture, but I just don''t see where the hope theme comes in. In another challenge (patterns, vanishing point(!)), this photo would probably get an 8 or 9 from me, but because the challenge is hope, I have to ratchet it down a few notches.</td>', 'Quite apart from the requirements of the challenge, this is a wonderful photograph, one that I wish I had the imagination and the opportunity to capture. The golden light, the tones of the sky and the ground, the lights in the distance. Amazing work. Now, how does it meet the challenge? I''m frankly not sure I see your point in the title. The lone person walking in the distance adds an element of loneliness to the picture, but I just don''t see where the hope theme comes in. In another challenge (patterns, vanishing point(!)), this photo would probably get an 8 or 9 from me, but because the challenge is hope, I have to ratchet it down a few notches.', '2004-08-25 23:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
