(878199, 99107, 24486, '<td valign="top">OK I''m probably a little biased here but nice shot. I hope you got the X ring with that arrow. Good perspective with the camera angled upwards. I have taken many similar photographs and I have found that perspective looks best.  I dont know how many others can appreciate what would be going through your mind at that moment but I would of been hoping for the perfect shot too, with the bow or photographically. Good luck with this one</td>', 'OK I''m probably a little biased here but nice shot. I hope you got the X ring with that arrow. Good perspective with the camera angled upwards. I have taken many similar photographs and I have found that perspective looks best.  I dont know how many others can appreciate what would be going through your mind at that moment but I would of been hoping for the perfect shot too, with the bow or photographically. Good luck with this one', '2004-08-26 06:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
