(878733, 99798, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nicely focused. Well lighted. Good composition.<br/> <br/> I see two weaknesses which detract from the photo. 1) The upper right has a background that is colored and textured in a way that is distracting. Since this is a set up shot, I would suggest a background that is more subtle. 2) And you could correct this one with a different crop ... I find the litle dark triangle of background in the lower left distracting.<br/> <br/>While I can find the word "hoped" in the photo, the tie in to the theme "hope" feels tenuous to me.</td>', 'Nicely focused. Well lighted. Good composition.  I see two weaknesses which detract from the photo. 1) The upper right has a background that is colored and textured in a way that is distracting. Since this is a set up shot, I would suggest a background that is more subtle. 2) And you could correct this one with a different crop ... I find the litle dark triangle of background in the lower left distracting. While I can find the word "hoped" in the photo, the tie in to the theme "hope" feels tenuous to me.', '2004-08-26 14:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
