(878750, 99416, 22970, '<td valign="top">This is a great photograph IMO. The color of the flowers stands out so vividly up against the black shirt. Great use of colors and use of DOF and I can almost feel the breeze blowing thru her hair. Great Shot! <br/> <br/></td>', 'This is a great photograph IMO. The color of the flowers stands out so vividly up against the black shirt. Great use of colors and use of DOF and I can almost feel the breeze blowing thru her hair. Great Shot!  ', '2004-08-26 14:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
