(878756, 98989, 18197, '<td valign="top">I could have scored this higher if the DOF was deeper, and the comp a bit less dead center (really the only two technical issues I am bothered by).<br/> <br/>The tie in to the theme seems weak to me. I brought the score down anothe point or two because of that.</td>', 'I could have scored this higher if the DOF was deeper, and the comp a bit less dead center (really the only two technical issues I am bothered by). The tie in to the theme seems weak to me. I brought the score down anothe point or two because of that.', '2004-08-26 14:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(878762, 99915, 18197, '<td valign="top">The sentiment is nice and loosely ties to the theme. This is a pretty difficult shot to attempt. The dark and detailed subject on the right and the light and low contrast subject on the left make exposure, contrast and balance veryy difficult. Colors seem okay. However it feels unbalanced to me. It feels pretty busy and may be a bit over sharpened.</td>', 'The sentiment is nice and loosely ties to the theme. This is a pretty difficult shot to attempt. The dark and detailed subject on the right and the light and low contrast subject on the left make exposure, contrast and balance veryy difficult. Colors seem okay. However it feels unbalanced to me. It feels pretty busy and may be a bit over sharpened.', '2004-08-26 14:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(878766, 99272, 22970, '<td valign="top">I think you done a good job of meeting the challenge. Good picture quality but I think your technique was off IMO. The church attendance/tithing board distracts me from the picture. I would of love to see this the picture with camera angle from behind the two subjects. Just my 2 cents worth  anyway its a good photograph.</td>', 'I think you done a good job of meeting the challenge. Good picture quality but I think your technique was off IMO. The church attendance/tithing board distracts me from the picture. I would of love to see this the picture with camera angle from behind the two subjects. Just my 2 cents worth  anyway its a good photograph.', '2004-08-26 14:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(878768, 99495, 22970, '<td valign="top">I didn''t even have to read the title to see the hope in your picture. Good photograph</td>', 'I didn''t even have to read the title to see the hope in your picture. Good photograph', '2004-08-26 14:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(878772, 99428, 18197, '<td valign="top">Hope floates? Yes, I suppose it does, but I''m not sure what that has to do with a mossy abandoned tire, a lone seagull and a rock strewn shore. I''m sure this sounds negative, but according to the rules, "While voting, users are asked to keep in highest consideration the topic of the challenge and base their rating accordingly. "</td>', 'Hope floates? Yes, I suppose it does, but I''m not sure what that has to do with a mossy abandoned tire, a lone seagull and a rock strewn shore. I''m sure this sounds negative, but according to the rules, "While voting, users are asked to keep in highest consideration the topic of the challenge and base their rating accordingly. "', '2004-08-26 14:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(878777, 99759, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo, both technically and aesthetically. Gave you an extra point for that. Not sure what it has to do with hope. "While voting, users are asked to keep in highest consideration the topic of the challenge and base their rating accordingly. "</td>', 'Very nice photo, both technically and aesthetically. Gave you an extra point for that. Not sure what it has to do with hope. "While voting, users are asked to keep in highest consideration the topic of the challenge and base their rating accordingly. "', '2004-08-26 14:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
