(879508, 99783, 16062, '<td valign="top">Striking picture!   Great contrast, I like the layers of sky and the texture of the ground.  Lots for the eye to do.  However, to me it doesn''t really convey hope.</td>', 'Striking picture!   Great contrast, I like the layers of sky and the texture of the ground.  Lots for the eye to do.  However, to me it doesn''t really convey hope.', '2004-08-26 23:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
