(879512, 98599, 25878, '<td valign="top">She needs tighter jeans.</td>', 'She needs tighter jeans.', '2004-08-26 23:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(879518, 99333, 10084, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful scene. Cropping the left and the right or simply zooming in closer would give the composition even more impact. The lighting really helps to make her glow. "9"</td>', 'What a wonderful scene. Cropping the left and the right or simply zooming in closer would give the composition even more impact. The lighting really helps to make her glow. "9"', '2004-08-26 23:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(879521, 98528, 19978, '<td valign="top">A truly exceptional shot. The way you''ve desaturated has created a sky with beautiful dark tones that contrasts perfectly with the model''s bright sunlit clothes and hat. This is nearly perfect. My absolute favorite for the challenge. Bumping to 10.</td>', 'A truly exceptional shot. The way you''ve desaturated has created a sky with beautiful dark tones that contrasts perfectly with the model''s bright sunlit clothes and hat. This is nearly perfect. My absolute favorite for the challenge. Bumping to 10.', '2004-08-26 23:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(879535, 99473, 25878, '<td valign="top">lol  funny</td>', 'lol  funny', '2004-08-27 00:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(879541, 99742, 19982, '<td valign="top">I think this one could have been better with some kind of natural lighting rather than using a flash.  The trouble with the flash is the harsh shadows in the background.  The wood paneling works well as a background.  The bench, however, is distracting.  So perhaps a repositioning the items or shooting from a different angle would have helped as well.</td>', 'I think this one could have been better with some kind of natural lighting rather than using a flash.  The trouble with the flash is the harsh shadows in the background.  The wood paneling works well as a background.  The bench, however, is distracting.  So perhaps a repositioning the items or shooting from a different angle would have helped as well.', '2004-08-27 00:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(879546, 99482, 25498, '<td valign="top">gorgeous sky- horizon a little crooked</td>', 'gorgeous sky- horizon a little crooked', '2004-08-27 00:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
