(879593, 99614, 19982, '<td valign="top">Wow... love the textures, the color, the emotion.  The one thing that could be done to improve this would be to simplify the background, either through a large aperature for shallow depth of field, or simply shoot from a different angle to get a cleaner background.  Good luck on the challenge!</td>', 'Wow... love the textures, the color, the emotion.  The one thing that could be done to improve this would be to simplify the background, either through a large aperature for shallow depth of field, or simply shoot from a different angle to get a cleaner background.  Good luck on the challenge!', '2004-08-27 00:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(879602, 99924, 19982, '<td valign="top">A powerful statement with such a simple illustration.  I like this because here is a photo that doesn''t "need" a title to help explain why it''s in this challenge.  Good job.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'A powerful statement with such a simple illustration.  I like this because here is a photo that doesn''t "need" a title to help explain why it''s in this challenge.  Good job.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-08-27 00:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
