(880774, 99134, 25742, '<td valign="top">good idea</td>', 'good idea', '2004-08-27 20:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(880776, 99705, 20435, '<td valign="top">This is great. After going through and voting this was the one so far that has made me really stop and say "wow" 1) Creative!!!! 2) Cute model 3) Great composition 4) Great color and detail 5) Great title. There is nothing negative to say about this photo as it is very well done and I think the most creative and well done photo for this subject. Her facial expression couldn''t be better. Way to go!</td>', 'This is great. After going through and voting this was the one so far that has made me really stop and say "wow" 1) Creative!!!! 2) Cute model 3) Great composition 4) Great color and detail 5) Great title. There is nothing negative to say about this photo as it is very well done and I think the most creative and well done photo for this subject. Her facial expression couldn''t be better. Way to go!', '2004-08-27 20:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(880777, 99779, 25742, '<td valign="top">very true</td>', 'very true', '2004-08-27 20:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(880780, 99631, 10390, '<td valign="top">One of the best photos in this challenge, a top 10 scorer imo and maybe a ribbon, great work.  The colors aren''t very real, but I think it maybe adds more to the photo as it is.  It would have been ok to crop half of the space above the model, but I''m not sure it would improve the photo.</td>', 'One of the best photos in this challenge, a top 10 scorer imo and maybe a ribbon, great work.  The colors aren''t very real, but I think it maybe adds more to the photo as it is.  It would have been ok to crop half of the space above the model, but I''m not sure it would improve the photo.', '2004-08-27 20:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(880782, 99893, 25742, '<td valign="top">and did you find your prince :)</td>', 'and did you find your prince :)', '2004-08-27 20:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(880791, 98701, 10390, '<td valign="top">Very emotive photo, I like it a lot.  The framing, the girls expressions, the choise of duotone and motive is just great.  Ok, there could be better focus on the kitten, but everything else justifies that. One of the best in this challenge imo, definately top 10 and it wouldn''t surprise me to see it in ribbon position.  Good luck.</td>', 'Very emotive photo, I like it a lot.  The framing, the girls expressions, the choise of duotone and motive is just great.  Ok, there could be better focus on the kitten, but everything else justifies that. One of the best in this challenge imo, definately top 10 and it wouldn''t surprise me to see it in ribbon position.  Good luck.', '2004-08-27 20:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(880797, 99060, 10390, '<td valign="top">I would place this photo very high in this challenge, maybe in top 10, it''s humourous and the composition is very good, I like it.</td>', 'I would place this photo very high in this challenge, maybe in top 10, it''s humourous and the composition is very good, I like it.', '2004-08-27 21:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(880799, 99397, 8005, '<td valign="top">How much did you have to pay her to sit still?</td>', 'How much did you have to pay her to sit still?', '2004-08-27 21:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(880801, 99139, 8005, '<td valign="top">What a great picture. I love the look on the child''s face. I have NEVER seen anyone hold a parrot like that. Very cool. 10 10 10</td>', 'What a great picture. I love the look on the child''s face. I have NEVER seen anyone hold a parrot like that. Very cool. 10 10 10', '2004-08-27 21:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(880803, 99126, 8005, '<td valign="top">I hope not. Good picture though.</td>', 'I hope not. Good picture though.', '2004-08-27 21:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(880811, 99058, 10390, '<td valign="top">I like this wedding shot, it could be a good idea to add some soft focus effect in it. Great composition, well done work.</td>', 'I like this wedding shot, it could be a good idea to add some soft focus effect in it. Great composition, well done work.', '2004-08-27 21:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(880813, 98528, 10390, '<td valign="top">This is maybe the winner photo for this challenge imo.  It is very well done, great lighting condition, great tones and contrast, good composition (a little more space above the girl''s head would make it great), great idea that conveys the challenge''s theme very well. I''ll be disappointed if this will not have a ribbon at least. good luck!</td>', 'This is maybe the winner photo for this challenge imo.  It is very well done, great lighting condition, great tones and contrast, good composition (a little more space above the girl''s head would make it great), great idea that conveys the challenge''s theme very well. I''ll be disappointed if this will not have a ribbon at least. good luck!', '2004-08-27 21:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(880815, 99914, 20779, '<td valign="top">The beautiful crest of light on the very top really makes this say "hope" for me. Wonderful shot. 8.</td>', 'The beautiful crest of light on the very top really makes this say "hope" for me. Wonderful shot. 8.', '2004-08-27 21:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(880816, 98885, 20779, '<td valign="top">Too cute! And, yes, he does look hopeful!</td>', 'Too cute! And, yes, he does look hopeful!', '2004-08-27 21:38:22.000000', NULL, 1);
