(881496, 99192, 19608, '<td valign="top">Exceptional image.  So simple yet effective.</td>', 'Exceptional image.  So simple yet effective.', '2004-08-28 14:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(881501, 98877, 19608, '<td valign="top">Superb image.  The face is just perfect - great lighting, great expression.  Hand is a bit soft but it is not distracting.</td>', 'Superb image.  The face is just perfect - great lighting, great expression.  Hand is a bit soft but it is not distracting.', '2004-08-28 14:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(881503, 99778, 19608, '<td valign="top">Exceptional lighting.  Colors are really magic.</td>', 'Exceptional lighting.  Colors are really magic.', '2004-08-28 14:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(881505, 98980, 19608, '<td valign="top">This is one great image.  Your choice of the slow shutter speed did wonders with the water - it''s magical.  The stopped down lens (or star filter) added a great touch to the light.  This should finish way up there!  Congratulations on a superb entry.</td>', 'This is one great image.  Your choice of the slow shutter speed did wonders with the water - it''s magical.  The stopped down lens (or star filter) added a great touch to the light.  This should finish way up there!  Congratulations on a superb entry.', '2004-08-28 14:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(881514, 98599, 4517, '<td valign="top">looks fine to me</td>', 'looks fine to me', '2004-08-28 14:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(881517, 99482, 4517, '<td valign="top">Great rays. Should have straightened horizon.</td>', 'Great rays. Should have straightened horizon.', '2004-08-28 14:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(881522, 98706, 4517, '<td valign="top">I`m guessing this is an upside down circumzenithal arc.</td>', 'I`m guessing this is an upside down circumzenithal arc.', '2004-08-28 14:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(881557, 99923, 3087, '<td valign="top">One of the best entries... even without the context of the challenge this would instantly evoke a memory of that hopeful question that leads to this well-known game. Slightly dark overall but lovely composition and detail.</td>', 'One of the best entries... even without the context of the challenge this would instantly evoke a memory of that hopeful question that leads to this well-known game. Slightly dark overall but lovely composition and detail.', '2004-08-28 15:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(881576, 99829, 245, '<td valign="top">This is really spectacular! The technicals could be a little nicer, but the concept is great, the composition and background is gorgeous, and it fits the challenge perfectly.</td>', 'This is really spectacular! The technicals could be a little nicer, but the concept is great, the composition and background is gorgeous, and it fits the challenge perfectly.', '2004-08-28 15:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(881587, 99790, 19248, '<td valign="top">Personally I find this picture tastless.</td>', 'Personally I find this picture tastless.', '2004-08-28 16:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(881591, 99450, 19248, '<td valign="top">I must be missing something here,  is the person in the picture Hope ?  Is the couple hoping for something unseen ?</td>', 'I must be missing something here,  is the person in the picture Hope ?  Is the couple hoping for something unseen ?', '2004-08-28 16:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(881594, 99931, 19248, '<td valign="top">Wow a hummingbird at rest.  What a shot.</td>', 'Wow a hummingbird at rest.  What a shot.', '2004-08-28 16:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(881609, 98989, 25773, '<td valign="top">I find the idea nicely fit with the contest but I think especially the bottom parts of the plant are underexposed and some -the closer- parts are out of focus. It''s not easy to get this shot with a clear bright sky (except maybe with a split ND filter).<br/>GC</td>', 'I find the idea nicely fit with the contest but I think especially the bottom parts of the plant are underexposed and some -the closer- parts are out of focus. It''s not easy to get this shot with a clear bright sky (except maybe with a split ND filter).GC', '2004-08-28 16:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(881616, 98913, 25773, '<td valign="top">I don''t really get why somebody is lying down to check it (getting prepared for the ''shock''?) but I think the idea is greatly fit with the contest and though I have smaller experience in portraiture I like the colors/soft lighting of this.</td>', 'I don''t really get why somebody is lying down to check it (getting prepared for the ''shock''?) but I think the idea is greatly fit with the contest and though I have smaller experience in portraiture I like the colors/soft lighting of this.', '2004-08-28 16:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(881630, 99679, 23104, '<td valign="top">ick. if they were meant to be ripped out we wouldn''t have them.</td>', 'ick. if they were meant to be ripped out we wouldn''t have them.', '2004-08-28 17:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(881650, 98528, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is another of very few entries that stand out to me as really conveying the theme to the viewer. I like the high contrast approach. The lack of any detail in the background adds a really surreal touch for me because I can''t imagine where she could be that there would be nothing whatsoever in the backdrop. Very nice.</td>', 'This is another of very few entries that stand out to me as really conveying the theme to the viewer. I like the high contrast approach. The lack of any detail in the background adds a really surreal touch for me because I can''t imagine where she could be that there would be nothing whatsoever in the backdrop. Very nice.', '2004-08-28 17:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(881654, 99090, 3087, '<td valign="top">A stunning image and one that relies on a less-is-more approach. I love that there is so little on display and yet such a strong sense of theme. The negative space really plays a role here. Wonderful.<br/> <br/>EDIT to correct typo!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-09-01 06:54:08.</i></td>', 'A stunning image and one that relies on a less-is-more approach. I love that there is so little on display and yet such a strong sense of theme. The negative space really plays a role here. Wonderful. EDIT to correct typo!', '2004-08-28 17:47:01.000000', '2004-09-01 07:54:08.000000', 1),
(881709, 99798, 3087, '<td valign="top">Faith and hope are certainly often very closely related for those who are religious. Given that I am not this image doesn''t appeal to me hugely in terms of content. More than that, the image itself isn''t aesthetically striking in any way - the angle of the book doesn''t seem particularly interesting; I can see a tiny sliver of the surface beneath the book at the left corner and yet because it''s so much darker than the main content it pulls my focus to i, the edges of the book are dirty and unattractive; the blue crinkly material at top right doesn''t seem to go with the material and adds another colour to the mix. Hope this is of some use and not too negative a criticism. Best of luck.</td>', 'Faith and hope are certainly often very closely related for those who are religious. Given that I am not this image doesn''t appeal to me hugely in terms of content. More than that, the image itself isn''t aesthetically striking in any way - the angle of the book doesn''t seem particularly interesting; I can see a tiny sliver of the surface beneath the book at the left corner and yet because it''s so much darker than the main content it pulls my focus to i, the edges of the book are dirty and unattractive; the blue crinkly material at top right doesn''t seem to go with the material and adds another colour to the mix. Hope this is of some use and not too negative a criticism. Best of luck.', '2004-08-28 18:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(881715, 99696, 14614, '<td valign="top">you''ve added a drama to the shot with your choice of colors and placement of your main elements.  well done - one of my ribbon picks this challenge</td>', 'you''ve added a drama to the shot with your choice of colors and placement of your main elements.  well done - one of my ribbon picks this challenge', '2004-08-28 18:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(881717, 99935, 14614, '<td valign="top">love the extra blue tint as it adds to the mood you''ve creates. one of my ribbon picks this challenge</td>', 'love the extra blue tint as it adds to the mood you''ve creates. one of my ribbon picks this challenge', '2004-08-28 18:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(881719, 99376, 14614, '<td valign="top">you got the clouds just right and the multiple blues are lovely.  one of my ribbon picks this challenge.  bol</td>', 'you got the clouds just right and the multiple blues are lovely.  one of my ribbon picks this challenge.  bol', '2004-08-28 18:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(881732, 99860, 25397, '<td valign="top">Very good color, I like how clear the bubble is.</td>', 'Very good color, I like how clear the bubble is.', '2004-08-28 19:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(881733, 99368, 25397, '<td valign="top">Not clear at all, I suggest a tripod and cropping.</td>', 'Not clear at all, I suggest a tripod and cropping.', '2004-08-28 19:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
