(881792, 99403, 15242, '<td valign="top">The title could be much better, but I don''t take off for that.  I like the shot.</td>', 'The title could be much better, but I don''t take off for that.  I like the shot.', '2004-08-28 19:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(881793, 98959, 3306, '<td valign="top">I like the halo of light. I wish the picture was a little sharper and colorful. I would like to see what it looks like in B &amp; W.</td>', 'I like the halo of light. I wish the picture was a little sharper and colorful. I would like to see what it looks like in B & W.', '2004-08-28 19:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
