(882141, 99578, 26115, '<td valign="top">Its a nice photo. Possibly the food could have been more in focus so it was more recognisable as well as maybe a contrasting colour? to balance the dark effects of the dog and to make it more recognisable from the rest of the white.<br/>Its a funny photo and it got a laugh out of me thats for sure so congratulations :)</td>', 'Its a nice photo. Possibly the food could have been more in focus so it was more recognisable as well as maybe a contrasting colour? to balance the dark effects of the dog and to make it more recognisable from the rest of the white.Its a funny photo and it got a laugh out of me thats for sure so congratulations :)', '2004-08-29 03:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(882158, 99132, 19608, '<td valign="top">OK - I''ve viewed this image several times.  It is captivating with wonderful colors and graphic design.  At first, I thought the "drops" were water drops and had convinced myself that it was upside down.  Now - I think they are air bubbles and it is right-side-up.  Then there''s the "hope" issue - I just can''t make it fit into that subject - as much as I really want to.  So - you get a really decent score for an imaginative and artistic image that would be better served in a different challenge.</td>', 'OK - I''ve viewed this image several times.  It is captivating with wonderful colors and graphic design.  At first, I thought the "drops" were water drops and had convinced myself that it was upside down.  Now - I think they are air bubbles and it is right-side-up.  Then there''s the "hope" issue - I just can''t make it fit into that subject - as much as I really want to.  So - you get a really decent score for an imaginative and artistic image that would be better served in a different challenge.', '2004-08-29 04:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(882159, 99377, 19608, '<td valign="top">SUPERB printing.  The whites are crisp and really white - the blacks are strong and dynamic.  And there is a great tonal range in between.  My highest B&amp;W in this challenge.  Composition is perfect as well.  Thanks for sharing.</td>', 'SUPERB printing.  The whites are crisp and really white - the blacks are strong and dynamic.  And there is a great tonal range in between.  My highest B&W in this challenge.  Composition is perfect as well.  Thanks for sharing.', '2004-08-29 04:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
