(882301, 99725, 21554, '<td valign="top">The shadows are soft and lovely.    I might have tried cropping closer to the baby''s head.  The mother is sufficiently present in the hair, the breast and the hand.   This would also take the baby''s head out of the center of the picture, usually a good thing.   Nicely conceived.  Beautifully captured.</td>', 'The shadows are soft and lovely.    I might have tried cropping closer to the baby''s head.  The mother is sufficiently present in the hair, the breast and the hand.   This would also take the baby''s head out of the center of the picture, usually a good thing.   Nicely conceived.  Beautifully captured.', '2004-08-29 10:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(882303, 99482, 19035, '<td valign="top">Straighten your horizon line, otherwise a wonderful capture.</td>', 'Straighten your horizon line, otherwise a wonderful capture.', '2004-08-29 10:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
