(882337, 99690, 24169, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice photo - depicts hope, hasn''t been ''shoehorned in'' and is a nice idea. But it doesn''t have the wow factor, at least not for me. I feel it''s a little busy? Maybe some cropping to make it a ''portrait'' shape rathyer than a landscape and to bring the attention to the statues. I find the pink flowers distracting also as they are the only bright colour in the photo.</td>', 'It''s a nice photo - depicts hope, hasn''t been ''shoehorned in'' and is a nice idea. But it doesn''t have the wow factor, at least not for me. I feel it''s a little busy? Maybe some cropping to make it a ''portrait'' shape rathyer than a landscape and to bring the attention to the statues. I find the pink flowers distracting also as they are the only bright colour in the photo.', '2004-08-29 10:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
