(882431, 99193, 12151, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo visually, but it doesn''t convey hope to me very much, probably because of the aloneness of the child.  The child is great, but he almost seems restricted into the (black &amp; white) concrete or structured background.  If you hadn''t titled it what you did, this photo honestly wouldn''t inspire much "hope" in me, and instead melancholy.</td>', 'This is a great photo visually, but it doesn''t convey hope to me very much, probably because of the aloneness of the child.  The child is great, but he almost seems restricted into the (black & white) concrete or structured background.  If you hadn''t titled it what you did, this photo honestly wouldn''t inspire much "hope" in me, and instead melancholy.', '2004-08-29 12:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(882432, 99062, 12151, '<td valign="top">Far away this didn''t look that impressive, but up close this is excellent.  I love the details shown in the texture and features of the face.  The blurring to the back is also a neat effect.  Visually the photo is excellent.  Overall, however, it doesn''t inspire hope so much as visual appreciation for the photo...  I think I want something more emotionally inspirational.</td>', 'Far away this didn''t look that impressive, but up close this is excellent.  I love the details shown in the texture and features of the face.  The blurring to the back is also a neat effect.  Visually the photo is excellent.  Overall, however, it doesn''t inspire hope so much as visual appreciation for the photo...  I think I want something more emotionally inspirational.', '2004-08-29 12:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(882433, 99612, 3087, '<td valign="top">The idea is very clear in this image and it''s easy to see how it relates to the challenge theme. The image has a gritty feel to it that comes from the grubby nature of the cards and the dark background. The image is interesting to me in that it does tell a story, but not particularly appealing aesthetically in the sense of my wanting to return to look at it again and again.</td>', 'The idea is very clear in this image and it''s easy to see how it relates to the challenge theme. The image has a gritty feel to it that comes from the grubby nature of the cards and the dark background. The image is interesting to me in that it does tell a story, but not particularly appealing aesthetically in the sense of my wanting to return to look at it again and again.', '2004-08-29 12:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(882443, 98952, 25623, '<td valign="top">I love the simplicity of this image!</td>', 'I love the simplicity of this image!', '2004-08-29 12:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(882447, 99798, 25623, '<td valign="top">If the topic was hope....  why faith?</td>', 'If the topic was hope....  why faith?', '2004-08-29 12:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(882450, 99779, 24896, '<td valign="top">No chance..sorry..2-3 weeks for the framing (if its a good crew) add a week for a cut roof if you don''t have trusses. Then 1-3 days for the roofers...and only then can the Elc, Plum, and Duct start. Then inspection (hope the inspectors not behind) then the framers come back for cleanup/windows, then stairs, insulators, drywall, trim carpenter, flooring, cabinets, railings and last painters.  By now the exterior should be finished they start after the windows are in. So my guess if everything runs smooth Early December but most likely the first of next year. Sorry<br/> <br/>As for the pic its a great location, horizon needs rotated a little. Solid entry but Im biased.<br/></td>', 'No chance..sorry..2-3 weeks for the framing (if its a good crew) add a week for a cut roof if you don''t have trusses. Then 1-3 days for the roofers...and only then can the Elc, Plum, and Duct start. Then inspection (hope the inspectors not behind) then the framers come back for cleanup/windows, then stairs, insulators, drywall, trim carpenter, flooring, cabinets, railings and last painters.  By now the exterior should be finished they start after the windows are in. So my guess if everything runs smooth Early December but most likely the first of next year. Sorry As for the pic its a great location, horizon needs rotated a little. Solid entry but Im biased.', '2004-08-29 12:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
