(882570, 99825, 24939, '<td valign="top">Good composition but the colors are a little dull and the lighting a little flat. Looks like you boosted the saturation of the greens but just looks like a very dull day. Unfortunate, but you gotta work with what you got during the week, still, nice idea.</td>', 'Good composition but the colors are a little dull and the lighting a little flat. Looks like you boosted the saturation of the greens but just looks like a very dull day. Unfortunate, but you gotta work with what you got during the week, still, nice idea.', '2004-08-29 15:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(882571, 99058, 22304, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice shot. The only thing I noticed was the right side of the grooms tuxedo seems to fade into the dark shadows.</td>', 'This is a really nice shot. The only thing I noticed was the right side of the grooms tuxedo seems to fade into the dark shadows.', '2004-08-29 15:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(882573, 98570, 24939, '<td valign="top">The exposure looks a little off. You have a very light background and a very dark foreground. Because the background is lighter it makes the eyes pay more attention to the background as the eyes automatically goes to the lighter part of an image. The shadows are also quite strong on the guy''s face and some of the details are lost. Ideally the fishermen should be lighter and the background darker. It also seems to lack some sharpness.</td>', 'The exposure looks a little off. You have a very light background and a very dark foreground. Because the background is lighter it makes the eyes pay more attention to the background as the eyes automatically goes to the lighter part of an image. The shadows are also quite strong on the guy''s face and some of the details are lost. Ideally the fishermen should be lighter and the background darker. It also seems to lack some sharpness.', '2004-08-29 15:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(882574, 98759, 22304, '<td valign="top">I really like the effect on the clouds, it will be interesting to hear how you acheived that. I''m not sure how well it mets the challenge though.</td>', 'I really like the effect on the clouds, it will be interesting to hear how you acheived that. I''m not sure how well it mets the challenge though.', '2004-08-29 15:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(882576, 99934, 24939, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and I love the light and texture on the drape. The lighting is really good overall in this image and I like the the shelf being lit too. Only thing that I see that needs improvement is the focus of the flowers. Try changing your aperature to get more of the frame in focus at the same time.</td>', 'Nice composition and I love the light and texture on the drape. The lighting is really good overall in this image and I like the the shelf being lit too. Only thing that I see that needs improvement is the focus of the flowers. Try changing your aperature to get more of the frame in focus at the same time.', '2004-08-29 15:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(882577, 99924, 24939, '<td valign="top">I like the depth of field to emphasize the hands and the diagonal of the arm. Only negative is that on this screen the image looks like it has a red cast. Auto levels or playing around with the white point may help correct the cast. (Otherwise it''s this monitor)</td>', 'I like the depth of field to emphasize the hands and the diagonal of the arm. Only negative is that on this screen the image looks like it has a red cast. Auto levels or playing around with the white point may help correct the cast. (Otherwise it''s this monitor)', '2004-08-29 15:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
