(882580, 99936, 24939, '<td valign="top">Good black background and I can see what you''re trying to do with the low contrast/soft focus but I''m not sure it works too well for me. I personally prefer more contrast and a deeper tonal range.</td>', 'Good black background and I can see what you''re trying to do with the low contrast/soft focus but I''m not sure it works too well for me. I personally prefer more contrast and a deeper tonal range.', '2004-08-29 15:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
