(882590, 99419, 24939, '<td valign="top">The idea works and it''s great you got the ball in the shot as they''re so hard to capture. To me this is more about a family memory snapshot then a ribbon-winning photograph. That doesnt mean it''s a bad shot, just that it wont be as appreciated by others as it will for McKayla and her family and friends.<br/></td>', 'The idea works and it''s great you got the ball in the shot as they''re so hard to capture. To me this is more about a family memory snapshot then a ribbon-winning photograph. That doesnt mean it''s a bad shot, just that it wont be as appreciated by others as it will for McKayla and her family and friends.', '2004-08-29 15:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
