(882675, 99578, 24939, '<td valign="top">Seems a little blurry to me.</td>', 'Seems a little blurry to me.', '2004-08-29 16:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(882677, 99770, 24939, '<td valign="top">I like how it fills the frame. Good lighting and exposure. Excellent mood. Wonderful find.</td>', 'I like how it fills the frame. Good lighting and exposure. Excellent mood. Wonderful find.', '2004-08-29 16:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(882679, 99791, 24939, '<td valign="top">Very nice contrast between the white and the dark blue sky. Interesting perspective too.</td>', 'Very nice contrast between the white and the dark blue sky. Interesting perspective too.', '2004-08-29 16:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(882680, 99071, 24939, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and clarity, nice sharpness with the baby''s eyes.</td>', 'Good lighting and clarity, nice sharpness with the baby''s eyes.', '2004-08-29 16:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(882681, 99451, 19608, '<td valign="top">This image give a soft warm feeling, very nice.  Lots of emotion keeps it a high score that would be higher yet if a) It was not so centered, and b) The border was less detracting.  Thanks for sharing a very stong entry.</td>', 'This image give a soft warm feeling, very nice.  Lots of emotion keeps it a high score that would be higher yet if a) It was not so centered, and b) The border was less detracting.  Thanks for sharing a very stong entry.', '2004-08-29 16:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(882682, 99783, 26132, '<td valign="top">awesome snap<br/></td>', 'awesome snap', '2004-08-29 16:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(882684, 99935, 19608, '<td valign="top">Moody - I like the overall blue cast for this.  Compositon is OK - but it seems the rock and the word should probably be a bit closer together.  Overall a strong image that should do well.</td>', 'Moody - I like the overall blue cast for this.  Compositon is OK - but it seems the rock and the word should probably be a bit closer together.  Overall a strong image that should do well.', '2004-08-29 16:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(882686, 99893, 19608, '<td valign="top">Fairy Tale is next week. Great lighting, the black background works well for this.  Exposure seems perfect.  I''d suggest you should crop out the nose altogether by cropping down from the top.</td>', 'Fairy Tale is next week. Great lighting, the black background works well for this.  Exposure seems perfect.  I''d suggest you should crop out the nose altogether by cropping down from the top.', '2004-08-29 16:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(882687, 99136, 19608, '<td valign="top">Moody and emotional.  The position of the shoulders does indeed invoke a feeling of hopelessness.  The strong diagonal OOF log in the foreground is really unfortunate.  Exposure seems perfect.</td>', 'Moody and emotional.  The position of the shoulders does indeed invoke a feeling of hopelessness.  The strong diagonal OOF log in the foreground is really unfortunate.  Exposure seems perfect.', '2004-08-29 16:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(882689, 98702, 19608, '<td valign="top">Cute image of the kitty, but I really want to see the eyes.  For hope - only the title would tend to lead you in that doirection.</td>', 'Cute image of the kitty, but I really want to see the eyes.  For hope - only the title would tend to lead you in that doirection.', '2004-08-29 16:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(882693, 98820, 19608, '<td valign="top">A fairly nice scene but the exposure is a stop (or more) over.  The washed out colors pretty much destroy it.  Composition is ok - but the guy with the ball on the left edge pulls you out of the image.</td>', 'A fairly nice scene but the exposure is a stop (or more) over.  The washed out colors pretty much destroy it.  Composition is ok - but the guy with the ball on the left edge pulls you out of the image.', '2004-08-29 16:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(882717, 99179, 23338, '<td valign="top">I''ve always been particial to artwork lit from within by a single candle.  One of my favorites is St. Joseph the Carpenter, a painting by Georges De La Tour in the 1600s.   It currently resides in the Louvre in Paris.  In that one the candle is hidden behind the young boy''s hand and actually turns the hand almost translucent as it lights up the painting.   This photo has much of the same quality - even to the religous connotation.  I really like it.  Congratulations.</td>', 'I''ve always been particial to artwork lit from within by a single candle.  One of my favorites is St. Joseph the Carpenter, a painting by Georges De La Tour in the 1600s.   It currently resides in the Louvre in Paris.  In that one the candle is hidden behind the young boy''s hand and actually turns the hand almost translucent as it lights up the painting.   This photo has much of the same quality - even to the religous connotation.  I really like it.  Congratulations.', '2004-08-29 16:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(882723, 99782, 23338, '<td valign="top">Ok, the candles are attracting me in this challenge.  Yours are really unique in that there is such a subtle contrast between the yellow and the reds, the bright flames and the dark background.   The repetition, row by row, and pattern of dispersion, add to the attractiveness of the image.  The only possible criticism, for which I do not have a suggested cure, is the question of where to crop.  The upper left candle is only partially shown and it would be nice to have as much dark space above the top row as there is below the bottom row - but, if including those extra areas in the image brings in other objects which would be distracting, then you did the right thing.  Oh, well, enough banter.  Really nice photo for a challenge on Hope.</td>', 'Ok, the candles are attracting me in this challenge.  Yours are really unique in that there is such a subtle contrast between the yellow and the reds, the bright flames and the dark background.   The repetition, row by row, and pattern of dispersion, add to the attractiveness of the image.  The only possible criticism, for which I do not have a suggested cure, is the question of where to crop.  The upper left candle is only partially shown and it would be nice to have as much dark space above the top row as there is below the bottom row - but, if including those extra areas in the image brings in other objects which would be distracting, then you did the right thing.  Oh, well, enough banter.  Really nice photo for a challenge on Hope.', '2004-08-29 17:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(882727, 99403, 23338, '<td valign="top">Oh, the contrasts!  Soft versus hard, bright white and colors vs. very dark and blacks, smooth vs. rough, organic vs. mineral, it all combines to make for a really attractive image.  Now, ... "Hope"?   Without the title I could probably come up with the word "hope" as one of my first ten guesses, but then, "Hope" is a very hard concept to convert into a stand-alone image.   And you''ve done a really great job.</td>', 'Oh, the contrasts!  Soft versus hard, bright white and colors vs. very dark and blacks, smooth vs. rough, organic vs. mineral, it all combines to make for a really attractive image.  Now, ... "Hope"?   Without the title I could probably come up with the word "hope" as one of my first ten guesses, but then, "Hope" is a very hard concept to convert into a stand-alone image.   And you''ve done a really great job.', '2004-08-29 17:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(882736, 99804, 23338, '<td valign="top">Nice job.  I like the composition: coffee cup, rose, glasses, bible, crochetted doily - it all fits together, both subject wise and in terms on color tones.  The rose image is picked up in the cup and "Hope" is framed in the glasses.  All very nice.   Only criticisms?  The rose looks kinda wilted (didn''t last through all your hard work); it would have been nice to have some stronger glasses so that "hope" was magnified slightly more, and the coffee is cold!  :-)   Really nice photo though.</td>', 'Nice job.  I like the composition: coffee cup, rose, glasses, bible, crochetted doily - it all fits together, both subject wise and in terms on color tones.  The rose image is picked up in the cup and "Hope" is framed in the glasses.  All very nice.   Only criticisms?  The rose looks kinda wilted (didn''t last through all your hard work); it would have been nice to have some stronger glasses so that "hope" was magnified slightly more, and the coffee is cold!  :-)   Really nice photo though.', '2004-08-29 17:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(882740, 99178, 23338, '<td valign="top">Just didn''t seem to fit the challenge - at least for me.  As a photo, it''s nice to have captured the moment, but even then - the dog is lost amongst all the background clutter and the rays of light underneath distract your eye.</td>', 'Just didn''t seem to fit the challenge - at least for me.  As a photo, it''s nice to have captured the moment, but even then - the dog is lost amongst all the background clutter and the rays of light underneath distract your eye.', '2004-08-29 17:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(882745, 99428, 23338, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry.  I don''t see any hope here.  A smelly, old, discarded tire with moss on it, some wet, cold rocks, and a bird full of dispair looking for its next meal of floating garbage.   I just don''t see it.  But, that could be me.</td>', 'I''m sorry.  I don''t see any hope here.  A smelly, old, discarded tire with moss on it, some wet, cold rocks, and a bird full of dispair looking for its next meal of floating garbage.   I just don''t see it.  But, that could be me.', '2004-08-29 17:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(882748, 99092, 23338, '<td valign="top">Give me ten trys and I wouldn''t have come up with the word "Hope".  Toad, frog, warts, damp, big eyes, nice browns and tans, Budweiser, dead leaves, (a couch or woodwork in the background?).  But, not "Hope".  Nope.</td>', 'Give me ten trys and I wouldn''t have come up with the word "Hope".  Toad, frog, warts, damp, big eyes, nice browns and tans, Budweiser, dead leaves, (a couch or woodwork in the background?).  But, not "Hope".  Nope.', '2004-08-29 17:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(882749, 99705, 6130, '<td valign="top">Lovely 10</td>', 'Lovely 10', '2004-08-29 17:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(882750, 99136, 6130, '<td valign="top">I love it. 10</td>', 'I love it. 10', '2004-08-29 17:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(882751, 99824, 23338, '<td valign="top">No "Hope" here.  Nice close up, though.</td>', 'No "Hope" here.  Nice close up, though.', '2004-08-29 17:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(882753, 99238, 6130, '<td valign="top">I like this photo.</td>', 'I like this photo.', '2004-08-29 17:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(882754, 99778, 6130, '<td valign="top">So Beautiful.</td>', 'So Beautiful.', '2004-08-29 17:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(882755, 99909, 6130, '<td valign="top">Funny.</td>', 'Funny.', '2004-08-29 17:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(882757, 99432, 23338, '<td valign="top">This is a really "busy" image - with not a lot to say for "Hope".   And that which might indicate "hope" is conflicting: Maybe the fish is "Hoping" for a meal, but "Silica Gel; Do Not Eat"?  And maybe a student somewhere is "Hoping" for a good test result, but I "Hope" you don''t mean the fish is.    :-)   Yep, there is a Unicorn in the background, too.  But, paper clips?  A piece of pipe fitting?  The edge of a paper towel?   A drum stick?  What IS all that stuff ... ?  I HOPE you got it cleaned up since then.  :-)</td>', 'This is a really "busy" image - with not a lot to say for "Hope".   And that which might indicate "hope" is conflicting: Maybe the fish is "Hoping" for a meal, but "Silica Gel; Do Not Eat"?  And maybe a student somewhere is "Hoping" for a good test result, but I "Hope" you don''t mean the fish is.    :-)   Yep, there is a Unicorn in the background, too.  But, paper clips?  A piece of pipe fitting?  The edge of a paper towel?   A drum stick?  What IS all that stuff ... ?  I HOPE you got it cleaned up since then.  :-)', '2004-08-29 17:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(882759, 99690, 23338, '<td valign="top">This image needs to be re-thought.  My reaction is that here are two pieces of statuary glued to some rocks with a jumble of rock and distracting plant patterns all around.  I would try and see if I could take it in such a fashion that the major bright white space of sky disappears, the background clumps of bushes are cropped out, and the image concentrates on the top 80% of the foreground image and all of the background image.  If you could then get some lighting effect showing the background figure with more brightness and detail, you would probably be heading in the right direction.  But, hey!  That''s just MY opinion.  I''m sure that there are plenty of others that WILL like it.  The kneeling (nun?) could be an attractive image.</td>', 'This image needs to be re-thought.  My reaction is that here are two pieces of statuary glued to some rocks with a jumble of rock and distracting plant patterns all around.  I would try and see if I could take it in such a fashion that the major bright white space of sky disappears, the background clumps of bushes are cropped out, and the image concentrates on the top 80% of the foreground image and all of the background image.  If you could then get some lighting effect showing the background figure with more brightness and detail, you would probably be heading in the right direction.  But, hey!  That''s just MY opinion.  I''m sure that there are plenty of others that WILL like it.  The kneeling (nun?) could be an attractive image.', '2004-08-29 17:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(882763, 99821, 23338, '<td valign="top">I was OK with this image until I started concentrating on the green tinsel at the bottom.  If that were cropped out, it would make a much better image. I kinda like the top portion, with the contrast of the reflective golds, the black background and the hints of flesh tones.  The tinsel just makes it seem so cheap.  But, that could be just me.</td>', 'I was OK with this image until I started concentrating on the green tinsel at the bottom.  If that were cropped out, it would make a much better image. I kinda like the top portion, with the contrast of the reflective golds, the black background and the hints of flesh tones.  The tinsel just makes it seem so cheap.  But, that could be just me.', '2004-08-29 18:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(882768, 99691, 23338, '<td valign="top">The "irony" for me is that I really liked your image, and I left it until last to comment on.  The reason was that I saw no "hope" in the image.  I saw a dark, foreboding soul drowning in the dispair of chronic alcoholism.  I saw Russian leaders, hiding their failures as human beings by losing themselves in the stupor of Vodka.  I saw no "Hope".  I DID see a striking, backlit image of contrasting yellows, reds and blacks which was really attractive.</td>', 'The "irony" for me is that I really liked your image, and I left it until last to comment on.  The reason was that I saw no "hope" in the image.  I saw a dark, foreboding soul drowning in the dispair of chronic alcoholism.  I saw Russian leaders, hiding their failures as human beings by losing themselves in the stupor of Vodka.  I saw no "Hope".  I DID see a striking, backlit image of contrasting yellows, reds and blacks which was really attractive.', '2004-08-29 18:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(882772, 99666, 23338, '<td valign="top">Hoping it doesn''t rain; Hoping to win a prize; Hoping she likes my car; Hoping someone buys this thing ...  without a title, this image doesn''t say "Hope" to me.  Nice car though.  And, nice colors and focus throughout.   If I were asked to photograph the car, I''d move it to a location without the clutter in the background, use some accent lighting, and if I wanted some other subject matter in the image, pick an attractive girl to pose with it.</td>', 'Hoping it doesn''t rain; Hoping to win a prize; Hoping she likes my car; Hoping someone buys this thing ...  without a title, this image doesn''t say "Hope" to me.  Nice car though.  And, nice colors and focus throughout.   If I were asked to photograph the car, I''d move it to a location without the clutter in the background, use some accent lighting, and if I wanted some other subject matter in the image, pick an attractive girl to pose with it.', '2004-08-29 18:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(882776, 99892, 23338, '<td valign="top">Take away the title and, Hey!  It''s just a frog!  And frogs are almost a dying species.  What "Hope" is there in that?  Nice pose by the frog though - and the focus and colors look pretty true to life also.</td>', 'Take away the title and, Hey!  It''s just a frog!  And frogs are almost a dying species.  What "Hope" is there in that?  Nice pose by the frog though - and the focus and colors look pretty true to life also.', '2004-08-29 18:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(882781, 98921, 23338, '<td valign="top">...  the tunnel?  Nice repitition of contrast and colors.  I like it.</td>', '...  the tunnel?  Nice repitition of contrast and colors.  I like it.', '2004-08-29 18:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(882785, 99132, 23338, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  Perplexes me as to how taken.  Underwater in a fish tank?   Upside down with droplets of water hanging?  It is kinda neat, but "Hope"?</td>', 'Nice image.  Perplexes me as to how taken.  Underwater in a fish tank?   Upside down with droplets of water hanging?  It is kinda neat, but "Hope"?', '2004-08-29 18:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(882800, 99334, 19608, '<td valign="top">Looks like a beautiful dog  - very intent.  However - the image is fairly "muddy"  - which menas there are no really srong whites in this case.  There are good blacks and a lot of grays, but the grays are grouped together on the tonal scale.  May be better if the left side were cropped off as it adds little. I really doubt if a dog understands the concept of hope, but since it was a hard challenge to shoot.....</td>', 'Looks like a beautiful dog  - very intent.  However - the image is fairly "muddy"  - which menas there are no really srong whites in this case.  There are good blacks and a lot of grays, but the grays are grouped together on the tonal scale.  May be better if the left side were cropped off as it adds little. I really doubt if a dog understands the concept of hope, but since it was a hard challenge to shoot.....', '2004-08-29 18:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(882804, 99495, 19608, '<td valign="top">Heck - I thought that was the coffee cup holder.  Nice try - but not really a valid hope....  Image is well shot and well printed.</td>', 'Heck - I thought that was the coffee cup holder.  Nice try - but not really a valid hope....  Image is well shot and well printed.', '2004-08-29 18:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(882810, 99606, 19608, '<td valign="top">I assume this is smoke - and the title implies you can smoke without increasing the chance of dying.  I doubt that that hope is a reality.  The image itself has some nice pattersn/lines but the tonal range is so slight it becomes un-interesting quickly.</td>', 'I assume this is smoke - and the title implies you can smoke without increasing the chance of dying.  I doubt that that hope is a reality.  The image itself has some nice pattersn/lines but the tonal range is so slight it becomes un-interesting quickly.', '2004-08-29 18:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(882821, 99778, 11756, '<td valign="top">love the contrasr in the colors would be good w/o the rainbow is superb w/ it</td>', 'love the contrasr in the colors would be good w/o the rainbow is superb w/ it', '2004-08-29 19:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(882822, 99197, 3087, '<td valign="top">I guess this is a cultural reference that doesn''t really ring bells with me - is it a hope chest or hope drawer type thing? I like the arrangement of the still life within the case but the image itself lacks punch - the interest is in the still life not in the image itself. I don''t think the vivid flooring works well with the muted colours of the aged items in the case.</td>', 'I guess this is a cultural reference that doesn''t really ring bells with me - is it a hope chest or hope drawer type thing? I like the arrangement of the still life within the case but the image itself lacks punch - the interest is in the still life not in the image itself. I don''t think the vivid flooring works well with the muted colours of the aged items in the case.', '2004-08-29 19:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(882827, 99734, 19608, '<td valign="top">Your composition is very strong - image is pleasing.  You need to use more of the alloted size so the image can be large enought to vote accurately.</td>', 'Your composition is very strong - image is pleasing.  You need to use more of the alloted size so the image can be large enought to vote accurately.', '2004-08-29 19:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(882828, 99509, 19608, '<td valign="top">A dynamic image - very threatening.   Without the title - it would not work.  With the title, it comes through the back door.</td>', 'A dynamic image - very threatening.   Without the title - it would not work.  With the title, it comes through the back door.', '2004-08-29 19:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(882830, 99937, 19608, '<td valign="top">Hoping to bloom? Aw c''mon.  The image has some good qualities, nice exposure and detail in the main subject.  Improve it by a) Not centering it so much, b) Getting closer and not having so much oof area.</td>', 'Hoping to bloom? Aw c''mon.  The image has some good qualities, nice exposure and detail in the main subject.  Improve it by a) Not centering it so much, b) Getting closer and not having so much oof area.', '2004-08-29 19:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(882832, 99909, 19608, '<td valign="top">Print is very well done.  Nice blacks, strong whites and a good tonal range.  Yoiu are probably tossing out half of the voters reactions by picking such a controversial subject.</td>', 'Print is very well done.  Nice blacks, strong whites and a good tonal range.  Yoiu are probably tossing out half of the voters reactions by picking such a controversial subject.', '2004-08-29 19:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(882834, 99908, 19608, '<td valign="top">Ah - the PUN MAN (or PUN WOMAN) has arrived on the scene!  I like the image - but think the tape should be moved up in the frame a bit.   The curved yellow line of the suds at the top is really strong.  Border does not work for me.</td>', 'Ah - the PUN MAN (or PUN WOMAN) has arrived on the scene!  I like the image - but think the tape should be moved up in the frame a bit.   The curved yellow line of the suds at the top is really strong.  Border does not work for me.', '2004-08-29 19:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(882847, 98983, 12268, '<td valign="top">I think if you took the collar off this would have been a really great shot &amp; would have fit the title &amp; challenge better. For the most part, it is a great shot &amp; techniquely well executed.</td>', 'I think if you took the collar off this would have been a really great shot & would have fit the title & challenge better. For the most part, it is a great shot & techniquely well executed.', '2004-08-29 20:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(882885, 99707, 15242, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo but the backlighting may be a bit too extreme.</td>', 'I really like this photo but the backlighting may be a bit too extreme.', '2004-08-29 21:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(882898, 99780, 17126, '<td valign="top">"Hmm... can''t think of anything for the challenge... Wow! that''s a pretty sky...  I got it! Hand + Sky = ...hope? eh, I got nothing else anyway..."<br/> <br/>Is that how it happened? LOL, pretty sky, but that''s it. 2</td>', '"Hmm... can''t think of anything for the challenge... Wow! that''s a pretty sky...  I got it! Hand + Sky = ...hope? eh, I got nothing else anyway..." Is that how it happened? LOL, pretty sky, but that''s it. 2', '2004-08-29 22:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(882900, 99273, 17126, '<td valign="top">Ok, let''s title this random picture "hope" and see if we can fool everyone...</td>', 'Ok, let''s title this random picture "hope" and see if we can fool everyone...', '2004-08-29 22:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(882902, 99912, 17126, '<td valign="top">would like a bit more contrast or something... not as bold as it could be i suppose. but i like the idea. 7</td>', 'would like a bit more contrast or something... not as bold as it could be i suppose. but i like the idea. 7', '2004-08-29 22:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
