(884251, 99738, 19978, '<td valign="top">Great idea, but a technically flawed image because: looks like he''s leaning to the right; too small (use your full 640 pix and 150K), too centered composition; blurry. Your photograph, with the above technical issues corrected, would''ve scored respectably well (top 3rd?).</td>', 'Great idea, but a technically flawed image because: looks like he''s leaning to the right; too small (use your full 640 pix and 150K), too centered composition; blurry. Your photograph, with the above technical issues corrected, would''ve scored respectably well (top 3rd?).', '2004-08-30 16:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(884254, 99676, 19978, '<td valign="top">It''s a stunning photograph, no doubt. Probably could be even better, but does it really meet the challenge? Apart from your title, there is nothing in the picture that really suggests hope. Technically adequate, so average score, but no higher.</td>', 'It''s a stunning photograph, no doubt. Probably could be even better, but does it really meet the challenge? Apart from your title, there is nothing in the picture that really suggests hope. Technically adequate, so average score, but no higher.', '2004-08-30 16:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(884258, 98612, 19978, '<td valign="top">A wonderful, golden shot. One of those rare opportunities that few of us can pass up! The relation to the hope theme is slim, or maybe even nonexistant. Without the title, most wouldn''t find any connection to the challenge at all. Very strong photograph, technically excellent, but have to give an average score.</td>', 'A wonderful, golden shot. One of those rare opportunities that few of us can pass up! The relation to the hope theme is slim, or maybe even nonexistant. Without the title, most wouldn''t find any connection to the challenge at all. Very strong photograph, technically excellent, but have to give an average score.', '2004-08-30 17:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(884262, 99735, 19978, '<td valign="top">Ah, very nice. I like your desat and love the black background. I also think your crop and composition is very effective. The shot is very suggestive of the theme for this challenge. Very well done!</td>', 'Ah, very nice. I like your desat and love the black background. I also think your crop and composition is very effective. The shot is very suggestive of the theme for this challenge. Very well done!', '2004-08-30 17:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
