(884403, 99869, 10985, '<td valign="top">Ah, finally a child photo that is well done. Many child/baby shots are done too hastily and lack impact. Children and babies are very cute, but that isn''t enough to make a good shot. This one is very well lit and presented. It carries the sweetness and even the feeling of the child. Excellent portrait and very good fit for the challenge.</td>', 'Ah, finally a child photo that is well done. Many child/baby shots are done too hastily and lack impact. Children and babies are very cute, but that isn''t enough to make a good shot. This one is very well lit and presented. It carries the sweetness and even the feeling of the child. Excellent portrait and very good fit for the challenge.', '2004-08-30 18:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
