(884903, 99705, 25464, '<td valign="top">I think this photo is a lovely example of how to convey a feeling.   I would have known how this relates to hope even if it had been without a title. 8.</td>', 'I think this photo is a lovely example of how to convey a feeling.   I would have known how this relates to hope even if it had been without a title. 8.', '2004-08-31 01:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
