(885722, 99777, 23956, '<td valign="top">With a title like this, it seems it would be better if the plant looked like it was still in the ground. As it is, you''ve just prematurely harvested the last hope. At least you didn''t show the end of the stem. :) Otherwise, it''s a good image, good use of fill flash. The bottom right is a bit dark.</td>', 'With a title like this, it seems it would be better if the plant looked like it was still in the ground. As it is, you''ve just prematurely harvested the last hope. At least you didn''t show the end of the stem. :) Otherwise, it''s a good image, good use of fill flash. The bottom right is a bit dark.', '2004-08-31 17:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
