(885975, 99614, 22734, '<td valign="top">Voted eralier. returning for commenrs.<br/> <br/>This is a very moving image deliniating human mortality and the aspirations which seek to over ride the flesh. The subject is so strong that I would have sought a plainer background, but nonetheless the clear focus of the hands drives home the point.</td>', 'Voted eralier. returning for commenrs. This is a very moving image deliniating human mortality and the aspirations which seek to over ride the flesh. The subject is so strong that I would have sought a plainer background, but nonetheless the clear focus of the hands drives home the point.', '2004-08-31 20:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
