(885980, 98576, 22734, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier. Returning for comments.<br/> <br/>A very above average study with that b/w grit,  with soothing black space to anchor the realm of hope and the unknown.</td>', 'Voted earlier. Returning for comments. A very above average study with that b/w grit,  with soothing black space to anchor the realm of hope and the unknown.', '2004-08-31 20:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(885983, 99033, 19708, '<td valign="top">Simple yet makes a statement.<br/>Actually one of the better submissions in this challenge.<br/>Well Done ((7))</td>', 'Simple yet makes a statement.Actually one of the better submissions in this challenge.Well Done ((7))', '2004-08-31 20:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(885988, 98616, 22734, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier.<br/> <br/>A very pensive study and wondeful b/w. We have all been here !</td>', 'Voted earlier. A very pensive study and wondeful b/w. We have all been here !', '2004-08-31 20:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(885990, 98795, 17126, '<td valign="top">beautiful, wish the horizon was horizontal. 7</td>', 'beautiful, wish the horizon was horizontal. 7', '2004-08-31 20:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(885991, 99272, 23956, '<td valign="top">There isn''t much of a composition here. This might have worked better as a vertical shot. You also ended up with some lens distortion, which is more obvious because of all the vertical lines in the shot. You can probably correct this with software, but in the future you might try using different focal lengths/zooms to find out where your camera/lens have the least distortion.</td>', 'There isn''t much of a composition here. This might have worked better as a vertical shot. You also ended up with some lens distortion, which is more obvious because of all the vertical lines in the shot. You can probably correct this with software, but in the future you might try using different focal lengths/zooms to find out where your camera/lens have the least distortion.', '2004-08-31 20:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(885993, 99738, 22734, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier. returning for comments.<br/> <br/>Ah, this is a beautiful and very well posed image. Even the lighting looks good, but you failed to take advantage of the size and in doing so you undermined this wonderful effort.</td>', 'Voted earlier. returning for comments. Ah, this is a beautiful and very well posed image. Even the lighting looks good, but you failed to take advantage of the size and in doing so you undermined this wonderful effort.', '2004-08-31 20:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(885994, 98965, 17126, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand why there are water droplets on the leaf. it''s a cool picture, but would be more believable and engaging if the water wasn''t there.<br/> <br/>kinda wish it wasn''t so centered either and had better color balance/contrast. 5</td>', 'I don''t understand why there are water droplets on the leaf. it''s a cool picture, but would be more believable and engaging if the water wasn''t there. kinda wish it wasn''t so centered either and had better color balance/contrast. 5', '2004-08-31 20:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(885995, 99924, 23956, '<td valign="top">Great idea! This shot would be wonderful if it weren''t for two things: The image is very soft (I''m sure you''ve been told this already) and the doctor''s coat should not be wrinkled.</td>', 'Great idea! This shot would be wonderful if it weren''t for two things: The image is very soft (I''m sure you''ve been told this already) and the doctor''s coat should not be wrinkled.', '2004-08-31 20:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(885997, 98591, 17126, '<td valign="top">i''m not gonna look at your title again, because i don''t understand it... i''m giving you a 9 because of the emotive quality and the appropriate graininess. :)<br/> <br/>...but what''s the title all about?</td>', 'i''m not gonna look at your title again, because i don''t understand it... i''m giving you a 9 because of the emotive quality and the appropriate graininess. :) ...but what''s the title all about?', '2004-08-31 20:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(885998, 99870, 17126, '<td valign="top">nice!!! kinda would like to see it rotated CW about 90 degrees, but just preference.<br/> <br/>one of the best this round. 10</td>', 'nice!!! kinda would like to see it rotated CW about 90 degrees, but just preference. one of the best this round. 10', '2004-08-31 20:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(886000, 98988, 23956, '<td valign="top">This is a picky detail, but then again picky details can make or break the shot. It really distracts me that one foot is covered and the other is exposed.</td>', 'This is a picky detail, but then again picky details can make or break the shot. It really distracts me that one foot is covered and the other is exposed.', '2004-08-31 20:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(886003, 98701, 23956, '<td valign="top">Finally! Now THIS is a great photo. I''d like for the kitten to be a bit sharper (faster shutter) but everything else is so great! The tonal range is excellent, the square composition is lovely... well done!</td>', 'Finally! Now THIS is a great photo. I''d like for the kitten to be a bit sharper (faster shutter) but everything else is so great! The tonal range is excellent, the square composition is lovely... well done!', '2004-08-31 20:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(886014, 99705, 19708, '<td valign="top">Well captured image, and one of the<br/>better submissions in this challenge.<br/>Well Done ((7))</td>', 'Well captured image, and one of thebetter submissions in this challenge.Well Done ((7))', '2004-08-31 20:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(886017, 99873, 23956, '<td valign="top">This looks like it needs to be rotated a couple degrees counter-clockwise.</td>', 'This looks like it needs to be rotated a couple degrees counter-clockwise.', '2004-08-31 20:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(886021, 98863, 23956, '<td valign="top">This would be better with a new sock, rather than an old one. Nice composition, though.</td>', 'This would be better with a new sock, rather than an old one. Nice composition, though.', '2004-08-31 20:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(886035, 99906, 2866, '<td valign="top">Good idea but I would suggest brightening up the exposure a stop or two. Also, you might consider squaring up the scale with the tile pattern.</td>', 'Good idea but I would suggest brightening up the exposure a stop or two. Also, you might consider squaring up the scale with the tile pattern.', '2004-08-31 21:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(886037, 99683, 2866, '<td valign="top">If the boy''s head was fully visable you would have a real winner.</td>', 'If the boy''s head was fully visable you would have a real winner.', '2004-08-31 21:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(886038, 98599, 22781, '<td valign="top">To bad about the backdrop...<br/>I guess this is a self portrait and NOT your girlfriend :)<br/>Like the photo, like the backside too, nothing wrong with it.  Don''t forget to  iron your sheet next time before using it as a backdrop, and watch out with those shadows... (8)</td>', 'To bad about the backdrop...I guess this is a self portrait and NOT your girlfriend :)Like the photo, like the backside too, nothing wrong with it.  Don''t forget to  iron your sheet next time before using it as a backdrop, and watch out with those shadows... (8)', '2004-08-31 21:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(886043, 99342, 2866, '<td valign="top">Clever.</td>', 'Clever.', '2004-08-31 21:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(886046, 98965, 23956, '<td valign="top">This would look much better if there were droplets on the other leaves as well. Like this, it looks too contrived.</td>', 'This would look much better if there were droplets on the other leaves as well. Like this, it looks too contrived.', '2004-08-31 21:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(886049, 98576, 3280, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot.  I like the lighting and positioning of your model.  Translates well for the challenge too.</td>', 'Excellent shot.  I like the lighting and positioning of your model.  Translates well for the challenge too.', '2004-08-31 21:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(886050, 99126, 3280, '<td valign="top">This one looks familiar...like a regular Pittsburgh sideline photographer.   Good shot and excellent transition for the challenge.  Now if you can just get them to come up with a "Roethlisberger" Challenge!</td>', 'This one looks familiar...like a regular Pittsburgh sideline photographer.   Good shot and excellent transition for the challenge.  Now if you can just get them to come up with a "Roethlisberger" Challenge!', '2004-08-31 21:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(886051, 99416, 3280, '<td valign="top">There were a number of "He loves me..." entries in the challenge but this was by far the best.  The yellow flowers against her black dress and the flow of her hair reall make the shot.  Excellent job.</td>', 'There were a number of "He loves me..." entries in the challenge but this was by far the best.  The yellow flowers against her black dress and the flow of her hair reall make the shot.  Excellent job.', '2004-08-31 21:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(886052, 99764, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice close up of the Mourning Dove.  Excellent clarity and background.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice close up of the Mourning Dove.  Excellent clarity and background.  Good job.', '2004-08-31 21:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(886053, 99670, 3280, '<td valign="top">Not your normal "pet" shot.   Good job.  My cat has the exact same dish!</td>', 'Not your normal "pet" shot.   Good job.  My cat has the exact same dish!', '2004-08-31 21:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(886054, 99058, 3280, '<td valign="top">Beautiful wedding shot.  The veil flowing in the wind and the offset of the couple really make it.  Excellent job!</td>', 'Beautiful wedding shot.  The veil flowing in the wind and the offset of the couple really make it.  Excellent job!', '2004-08-31 21:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(886055, 99192, 3280, '<td valign="top">Fantastic sillouette!  The blue of the sky really sets it off.  Excellent job.</td>', 'Fantastic sillouette!  The blue of the sky really sets it off.  Excellent job.', '2004-08-31 21:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(886056, 98945, 3280, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry but "nothing to say" is about my comment as well!  ;-)</td>', 'I''m sorry but "nothing to say" is about my comment as well!  ;-)', '2004-08-31 21:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(886058, 99893, 3280, '<td valign="top">Great  shot and idea.  The clarity and background are excellent.  I would have possibly brightened up the lipstick a bit but perhaps it wore off after multiple kissed for the photo!!</td>', 'Great  shot and idea.  The clarity and background are excellent.  I would have possibly brightened up the lipstick a bit but perhaps it wore off after multiple kissed for the photo!!', '2004-08-31 21:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(886059, 99682, 3280, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  I really like the setup with the lighting although I wonder what it would look like if the photo wasn''t quite so centered.</td>', 'Great shot!  I really like the setup with the lighting although I wonder what it would look like if the photo wasn''t quite so centered.', '2004-08-31 21:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(886061, 99506, 3280, '<td valign="top">Best of all of the fishing shots. (and there were a bunch!)  The look on your subject is priceless.  I love the background and offset of your model.  Excellent!</td>', 'Best of all of the fishing shots. (and there were a bunch!)  The look on your subject is priceless.  I love the background and offset of your model.  Excellent!', '2004-08-31 21:35:12.000000', NULL, 1);
