(886102, 99934, 25232, '<td valign="top">Good composition. If the flowers were brought into better focus and the curtain blurred more it would be a much better image.</td>', 'Good composition. If the flowers were brought into better focus and the curtain blurred more it would be a much better image.', '2004-08-31 21:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
