(886105, 98945, 25232, '<td valign="top">Nice sky.</td>', 'Nice sky.', '2004-08-31 21:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(886106, 99631, 24896, '<td valign="top">Excellent pic....I looked at this for along time before deciding what to comment on....your model has perfect expression looks very relaxed and totally unaware of the camera. I love how her hair frames her face but doesnt cover her eyes. The natural light and desaturation of the background I think are perfect for this pic.  I dont like the watch on her hand its too close to the flower and battles for my attention. I also think having her foot in focus would help. <br/> <br/>Very good entry<br/></td>', 'Excellent pic....I looked at this for along time before deciding what to comment on....your model has perfect expression looks very relaxed and totally unaware of the camera. I love how her hair frames her face but doesnt cover her eyes. The natural light and desaturation of the background I think are perfect for this pic.  I dont like the watch on her hand its too close to the flower and battles for my attention. I also think having her foot in focus would help.  Very good entry', '2004-08-31 21:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
