(886154, 98616, 22975, '<td valign="top">My eyes are tearing up... this is so moving, and so beautifully done.  Nothing in this challenge has had an emotional effect on me at all, but this... woah.  Congratulations on my favorite in Hope... and it''s because of this photo''s distinct absence of Hope.  I hope everyone else sees the beauty and delicacy of this.</td>', 'My eyes are tearing up... this is so moving, and so beautifully done.  Nothing in this challenge has had an emotional effect on me at all, but this... woah.  Congratulations on my favorite in Hope... and it''s because of this photo''s distinct absence of Hope.  I hope everyone else sees the beauty and delicacy of this.', '2004-08-31 22:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
