(886310, 99936, 12151, '<td valign="top">This is a striking image.  It''s beautiful.  For your knowledge, though, the image is more haunting to me than hopeful, and I think it has to do with the black &amp; white soft quality of everything, as well as the black background, disembodied hand, and plucked flower head...  This is really a strange, surreal photo.  It''s ghost-like.</td>', 'This is a striking image.  It''s beautiful.  For your knowledge, though, the image is more haunting to me than hopeful, and I think it has to do with the black & white soft quality of everything, as well as the black background, disembodied hand, and plucked flower head...  This is really a strange, surreal photo.  It''s ghost-like.', '2004-09-01 00:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(886312, 99696, 6349, '<td valign="top">I love that the person is in it.  This image reminds me of a guy I met out in San Jose California who had a book of published photography where he went out to old abandoned places in the desert in the middle of the night and painted with different colored lights with extremely long shutter speeds.  Great image here.</td>', 'I love that the person is in it.  This image reminds me of a guy I met out in San Jose California who had a book of published photography where he went out to old abandoned places in the desert in the middle of the night and painted with different colored lights with extremely long shutter speeds.  Great image here.', '2004-09-01 00:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(886313, 99192, 6349, '<td valign="top">I cannot imagine a better silhouette photo.  Outstanding work.  10</td>', 'I cannot imagine a better silhouette photo.  Outstanding work.  10', '2004-09-01 00:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
