(886690, 99606, 24981, '<td valign="top">WOW! Thanks for the 9 and 10 vote! :D<br/> <br/>Here''s the <a href="//img.photobucket.com/albums/v440/ggbudge/UndyingHope-unedited.jpg" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Unedited Version</a> - Caution: it''s 1.6MB<br/> <br/>For those of you who didn''t see the ghostly image, if you look about a quarter of the way down from the top in the center, there appears to be an eye. If you follow the image from there, you should see the face of a man.<br/> <br/>The man appears to be wearing the uniform of a US Civil War Soldier.<br/> <br/>I titled it Undying Hope because the "ghost" in the photo is still searching for something. That, to me, shows Hope.</td>', 'WOW! Thanks for the 9 and 10 vote! :D Here''s the Unedited Version - Caution: it''s 1.6MB For those of you who didn''t see the ghostly image, if you look about a quarter of the way down from the top in the center, there appears to be an eye. If you follow the image from there, you should see the face of a man. The man appears to be wearing the uniform of a US Civil War Soldier. I titled it Undying Hope because the "ghost" in the photo is still searching for something. That, to me, shows Hope.', '2004-09-01 01:53:05.000000', NULL, 0),
