(887118, 98983, 10268, '<td valign="top">Hey Sue, congrats on the placement!<br/> <br/>I did not vote in the challange, and I don''t think I would have scored your photo highly if I did.  There''s something about caged animals that really get me angry.<br/> <br/>But having read more of what you''re writtin, I think it''s a great idea!  This image certainly does send out vibes of hope, and looking at those dogs eyes really make me want to cry, and run and pick it up and take it home.<br/> <br/>One of the most powerful photos I''ve seen on here.  Added it to my faves, and good luck if you ever get that camaign off the ground!  This photo is a great start.</td>', 'Hey Sue, congrats on the placement! I did not vote in the challange, and I don''t think I would have scored your photo highly if I did.  There''s something about caged animals that really get me angry. But having read more of what you''re writtin, I think it''s a great idea!  This image certainly does send out vibes of hope, and looking at those dogs eyes really make me want to cry, and run and pick it up and take it home. One of the most powerful photos I''ve seen on here.  Added it to my faves, and good luck if you ever get that camaign off the ground!  This photo is a great start.', '2004-09-01 05:17:30.000000', NULL, 0),
