(887563, 99775, 25655, '<td valign="top">C''mon guys, haven''t you heard of "the Kotel"?? The western wall in Jerusalem? <br/>Man... and I thought my knowledge in world geography was poor... :(<br/> <br/>Anyway, it''s just a miniature model - but a good one!<br/>Wonderful picture! great lighting, original idea! <br/>Too bad so little knew what it was all about. I think it should''ve been in a much higher place.<br/> <br/>- - - <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.jinjit.co.il/icons/emoticons/11.gif'', strrpos(''//www.jinjit.co.il/icons/emoticons/11.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.jinjit.co.il/icons/emoticons/11.gif"/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-09-01 09:02:32.</i></td>', 'C''mon guys, haven''t you heard of "the Kotel"?? The western wall in Jerusalem? Man... and I thought my knowledge in world geography was poor... :( Anyway, it''s just a miniature model - but a good one!Wonderful picture! great lighting, original idea! Too bad so little knew what it was all about. I think it should''ve been in a much higher place. - - - ', '2004-09-01 10:01:40.000000', '2004-09-01 10:02:32.000000', 0),
