(888315, 98528, 19708, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by arngrimur:</b></div><hr/><i> This one deserved the blue ribbon.<br/>After looking at the color version<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=101955" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/19708/thumb/101955.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/19708/thumb/101955.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/19708/thumb/101955.jpg"/></a> <br/>I wonder if you didn''t have a hard time choosing which one to submit? </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Hi Arngrimur,<br/>Trust me I did. As much as I liked the original color version (which was not PP by the way, just Neat Imaged for noise), when I did the Tritone, something  emotionally hit deeper with the B &amp; W version.<br/>Regards,</td>', 'Originally posted by arngrimur: This one deserved the blue ribbon.After looking at the color version I wonder if you didn''t have a hard time choosing which one to submit?  Hi Arngrimur,Trust me I did. As much as I liked the original color version (which was not PP by the way, just Neat Imaged for noise), when I did the Tritone, something  emotionally hit deeper with the B & W version.Regards,', '2004-09-01 17:00:19.000000', NULL, 0),
