(891078, 98528, 19708, '<td valign="top">Wanted to add an additional Thank You here as <strike>19 members</strike> 23 members have put this shot in their favorites now. Wow!<br/> <br/><i>(I also can''t wait to get the print in hand and give it<br/>to my Niece. Her Mom &amp; Dad loved the shot, but don''t have<br/>a decent printer).</i> <br/> <br/>Kind regards all,<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-09-09 00:50:16.</i></td>', 'Wanted to add an additional Thank You here as 19 members 23 members have put this shot in their favorites now. Wow! (I also can''t wait to get the print in hand and give itto my Niece. Her Mom & Dad loved the shot, but don''t havea decent printer).  Kind regards all,', '2004-09-03 13:33:57.000000', '2004-09-09 01:50:16.000000', 0),
(891375, 99416, 25143, '<td valign="top">what a great picture !! I love the way the hair is the only thing indicating movement through two nicely parallel windblown lines - good too that the face is slightly obscured to add focus to the ''action'' in the hands and the rest remains calm and pensive</td>', 'what a great picture !! I love the way the hair is the only thing indicating movement through two nicely parallel windblown lines - good too that the face is slightly obscured to add focus to the ''action'' in the hands and the rest remains calm and pensive', '2004-09-03 15:40:20.000000', NULL, 0),
