(893945, 99920, 25183, '<td valign="top">"focus and clarity override staying on-topic"<br/>hmm...I don''t know.  I think the fuzziness was one of the things I liked about the photo.  It made me feel it was late at night, you''ve been driving through the darkness for hours, the gas light is on and the gas station is in sight.  HOPE is in sight!  This photo impressed me exactly as it is!</td>', '"focus and clarity override staying on-topic"hmm...I don''t know.  I think the fuzziness was one of the things I liked about the photo.  It made me feel it was late at night, you''ve been driving through the darkness for hours, the gas light is on and the gas station is in sight.  HOPE is in sight!  This photo impressed me exactly as it is!', '2004-09-05 14:34:32.000000', NULL, 0),
