(951840, 99604, 1031, '<td valign="top">I think the trees provide a needed context at the bottom so I wouldn''t crop them any more. I might take a little off the right (maybe a teensy bit from the left too) to get it to a completely square crop.<br/> <br/>Since the trees are already in silhouette, I would use a Curve adjustment to darken/increase the contrast in the clouds to bring out the rays even more.</td>', 'I think the trees provide a needed context at the bottom so I wouldn''t crop them any more. I might take a little off the right (maybe a teensy bit from the left too) to get it to a completely square crop. Since the trees are already in silhouette, I would use a Curve adjustment to darken/increase the contrast in the clouds to bring out the rays even more.', '2004-10-09 14:12:52.000000', NULL, 0),
