(1566245, 99790, 9581, '<td valign="top">I''d say you have this one down to a science with all the light there. Its  really standing out good from the back. The colors are perfect and its all in focus. I just have to go out and buy me a bag of those kisses now.. My favorite and I have been wanting some caramel filled for the past two weeks...I think this a great composition. You have done so good with all the technicalities of shooting...<br/>  Anyways  I have  tried a halogen bulb, you say work lamps, by this do you mean the silver ones with clamps? They are a bit bright it helps to point them up at something white and have the white sord of act as a light reflector... That is what I was trying in this shot..<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=151505" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/9581/thumb/151505.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/9581/thumb/151505.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/9581/thumb/151505.jpg"/></a> <br/>Though its way overexposed and I can tell it now. I have started understanding more by reading your comments on your shots. Your descriptions on your process are very much in detail and helps to think about what I can fix in my camera.</td>', 'I''d say you have this one down to a science with all the light there. Its  really standing out good from the back. The colors are perfect and its all in focus. I just have to go out and buy me a bag of those kisses now.. My favorite and I have been wanting some caramel filled for the past two weeks...I think this a great composition. You have done so good with all the technicalities of shooting...  Anyways  I have  tried a halogen bulb, you say work lamps, by this do you mean the silver ones with clamps? They are a bit bright it helps to point them up at something white and have the white sord of act as a light reflector... That is what I was trying in this shot.. Though its way overexposed and I can tell it now. I have started understanding more by reading your comments on your shots. Your descriptions on your process are very much in detail and helps to think about what I can fix in my camera.', '2005-07-27 06:23:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(1612937, 98701, 37276, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot Sandy - this is soooo sweet. As usual, getting hammered in the challenge (rain) but that''s ok. I actually expected it - we didn''t get rain here in CA so I did it my style. :)<br/>CONGRATS on the new camera - I am still working my husband to let me upgrade mine... :) It''s a slow process but I made a ton of money this summer from photo shoots, so... I can see a big style change in your shots in that last few months - I really like the progress you''ve made and how your confidence is showing through. Again - I am soooo happy for your new camera - I have camera envy. :D</td>', 'Wonderful shot Sandy - this is soooo sweet. As usual, getting hammered in the challenge (rain) but that''s ok. I actually expected it - we didn''t get rain here in CA so I did it my style. :)CONGRATS on the new camera - I am still working my husband to let me upgrade mine... :) It''s a slow process but I made a ton of money this summer from photo shoots, so... I can see a big style change in your shots in that last few months - I really like the progress you''ve made and how your confidence is showing through. Again - I am soooo happy for your new camera - I have camera envy. :D', '2005-08-15 17:41:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(1636997, 98983, 39209, '<td valign="top">This is just lovely. Makes me want to pick him up and take him home. Exactly what the shot should do.</td>', 'This is just lovely. Makes me want to pick him up and take him home. Exactly what the shot should do.', '2005-08-23 21:32:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(1750102, 98701, 10985, '<td valign="top">This is very sweet. I especially like the look on the onlooking girl.<br/> <br/>The mother of this kitten was probably moving her babies to a new location, one by one, and this one was found before the mother could come back for it. It is common for cat mothers to move their babies to a new place when they feel a threat in the present location. I hope the little one does OK.</td>', 'This is very sweet. I especially like the look on the onlooking girl. The mother of this kitten was probably moving her babies to a new location, one by one, and this one was found before the mother could come back for it. It is common for cat mothers to move their babies to a new place when they feel a threat in the present location. I hope the little one does OK.', '2005-09-30 10:38:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(1750922, 98701, 26464, '<td valign="top">this shot looks straight out of a community newspaper. i can almost see the blurb in the paper underneath it what is happening. good work to get in close and frame! (ps how much cropping did you do?)<br/> <br/></td>', 'this shot looks straight out of a community newspaper. i can almost see the blurb in the paper underneath it what is happening. good work to get in close and frame! (ps how much cropping did you do?) ', '2005-09-30 18:29:46.000000', NULL, 0),
