(2903383, 98528, 60862, '<td valign="top">This is as close to a perfect shot as I''ve ever seen.  The combination of youthful hope, the optimism of watering that small tree, and the birdhouse waiting to be put up.  Just spectacular.<br/> <br/>It also resonates with me personally.  We have two small trees in our front yard:  a dogwood we planted at about 6'' high that 10 years later that''s now twice as high and a "volunteer" japanese maple that planted itself and was so small I used to joke about not mowing it over.  It''s now about 4 feet high.<br/> <br/>When I think about how to tell a story with a photo, this will be my model!</td>', 'This is as close to a perfect shot as I''ve ever seen.  The combination of youthful hope, the optimism of watering that small tree, and the birdhouse waiting to be put up.  Just spectacular. It also resonates with me personally.  We have two small trees in our front yard:  a dogwood we planted at about 6'' high that 10 years later that''s now twice as high and a "volunteer" japanese maple that planted itself and was so small I used to joke about not mowing it over.  It''s now about 4 feet high. When I think about how to tell a story with a photo, this will be my model!', '2006-10-06 15:11:48.000000', NULL, 0),
