(3584387, 98983, 67145, '<td valign="top">hi sue ... thanx for comment ... i havent seen your work before so i thought i''d come visit .. this is the first one that i''ve opened coz i just love dogs ... they are the most beautiful creatures .. this photograph absolutely captures that divine and wonderful ''thing'' that they have ... i cant even express it .. a look of hope, love, TRUST .. congratulations on an amazing photograph and a great place in the challenge ..</td>', 'hi sue ... thanx for comment ... i havent seen your work before so i thought i''d come visit .. this is the first one that i''ve opened coz i just love dogs ... they are the most beautiful creatures .. this photograph absolutely captures that divine and wonderful ''thing'' that they have ... i cant even express it .. a look of hope, love, TRUST .. congratulations on an amazing photograph and a great place in the challenge ..', '2007-04-26 07:03:36.000000', NULL, 0),
