(4156451, 98528, 16241, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Brad:</b></div><hr/><i> Wanted to add an additional Thank You here as <strike>19 members</strike> 23 members have put this shot in their favorites now. Wow!<br/> <br/><i>(I also can''t wait to get the print in hand and give it<br/>to my Niece. Her Mom &amp; Dad loved the shot, but don''t have<br/>a decent printer).</i> <br/> <br/>Kind regards all, </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>53 now</td>', 'Originally posted by Brad: Wanted to add an additional Thank You here as 19 members 23 members have put this shot in their favorites now. Wow! (I also can''t wait to get the print in hand and give itto my Niece. Her Mom & Dad loved the shot, but don''t havea decent printer).  Kind regards all,   53 now', '2007-10-10 04:27:02.000000', NULL, 0),
