(6775875, 99024, 69008, '<td valign="top">The first thing that I notice about this  image is the composition being a lot of lined up squares. Squares everywhere, the box the tiles, the tree box, the accordion, even the crop.  It makes the not square shape of the guy stand out even more.  The photo in the box is a plus as well.  This is good street photography!</td>', 'The first thing that I notice about this  image is the composition being a lot of lined up squares. Squares everywhere, the box the tiles, the tree box, the accordion, even the crop.  It makes the not square shape of the guy stand out even more.  The photo in the box is a plus as well.  This is good street photography!', '2012-05-22 23:28:50.000000', NULL, 0);
